<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MRK- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maliku</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mali</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maliku</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na Maliku</para>
  <para style="mt2">Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maliku</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu wa Maliku</para>
  <para style="ip">Habali Maha handa liyandikiliwi na Maliku ni kimonga gha vihitabu vinjechi vya litangasu vilongelela kulikala kwa Yesu Kilisito, kila kimonga paghati gha hagha kingukemwa, “Litangasu” limanyika handa, “Lilandu Maha lya Sapanga” Matayu, Maliku na Lukasisi pamonga na Yohanaviyandikiliwi kuulongolo gha kihu kya Yesu, litangasu handa liyandikiliwi na Maliku ni hupi paghati gha matangasu hyogha manjechi. Hilahila inguwachilwa yiwa kiyandikiliwi kya kuulongolo paghati gha matangasu hyogha manjechi na inguwachilwa iwelili lipindi lya 65-70 badili gha kuweleka Kilisito. Wandu wa mayandiko watangala wangukwinila yiwa kiyandikiliwi Loma kwa lukani lwa kuwataya moyu Wakilisito wa kula Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maliku hilahila angumanyika handa Yohana Maliku, awelili muyao na Mndumindumi Paulo na Balinaba ila utumikila ghaki uhakilili paawalekilili kumwanja ghao wa kutumikila, uloli kumayandiku, Matendu 13:13. Kuulongolo Maliku atyangilili kangi pamonga na Balinaba, uloli kumayandiko, Matendu 15:37-39. Hilahila Maliku awelili na ughanja wa pabehi nesu na Petelo. Pamonga na Maliku kalola ng'ogha kulikala kwa Yesu kwa mihu ila wandu wa mayandiko wangukwinila yiwa Maliku ayandikili nesu ulangihi wa Petelo na hau ndiwa mtumbulo wa litangasu handa liyandikiliwi na Maliku kulitangasu Maliku alolili kuutumikila na mavulo gha Yesu kulipindi lya mwihu. Litangasu kwa uhupi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Maliku angulangiha Mayandiko kuhitabu kusula gha 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Maliku angulongela utumikila wa Yesu paawelili ku Galilaya kusula gha 1:14-8:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Maliku angulongela mwanja gha Yesu ku Yelusalemu kusula gha 8:22-10:52.</para>
  <para style="io">Maliku anguyomola kwa kuyandika ghala lipindi Yesu awelili ku Yelusalemu ikilongela kihu kyaki na uhinduki ghaki na hai inguloleka kusula gha 11:1-16:8.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatisa anguwatangasila wandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayu 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Hali ni Lilando lya maha lya Yesu Kilisito, Mwana wa Sapanga.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Itumbulili handa iyandikilwi kukihitabu kya mlota wa Sapanga Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Sapanga ailongile, ‘Ningumlaghila mndumindumi wa nenga akulonguleli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">avile atekuyandalila njila.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Lilowi lya mtumikila wa Sapanga lingukema mluvagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">Mumgholeli Bambu njila ghaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">mgholi mula atetyanga.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohanambatisa ahumilili mluvagha, akawatangasila wandu na</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:4">kuwabatisa akilonga, “Mleki sambi na Sapanga awalekeseli sambi zyenu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Wandu kuhuma mlima wogha wa Yudasia na wandu wogha wa mbwani wa Yelusalemu wakamyendela, wakasileka sambi syao na kumhyukila Sapanga, na mweni akawabatisa mulweni Joludani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohanaawelile akivala nguu igholilwi na mipuku gha mkokolo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:6">angukemwa ngamiya na luhunga lya ngosi kukibulibulilo kyaki. Mulyo ghaki uwelili nzige na bhuche. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Mweni atangasili akilonga, “Kanguhika badili gha nenga mweni makakala kumbita nenga, na nenga nipalilwi ng'ogha hata kuyinama na kuwoposola lughoyi lya hilatu ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nenga ninguwabatisa kwa masi, ila mweni atewabatisa kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatiswa na kuyeswa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matayu 3:13-4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Machuwa ghala, Yesu akahuma Nazaleti, kumbwani wa Galilaya, abatiswi kulweni Yoludani na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Palapala paahumili mmasi, akalola kundumba kuwopoka na Mpumulo wa Sapanga akimyingila Yesu lipindi paahumili mmasi akiwela na muwoneko wa ngunda. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Lilowi liyughanililwi kuhuma kundumba, “Wenga ni Mwana wa nenga mpalwa, ningupaliwa na wenga.” <verse eid="MRK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Palapala akalongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kuyenda kuluvagha, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />alikalili kula machuwa ialobaini, na kula Nkosi wa mahoka limuyesili. Awelili kula pamonga na mikokolo gha kumwitu, na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wakawela wangumtumikila.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwakema walopola wanjechi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matayu 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Yohanapakavikwa muuwopwa, Yesu ayendili ku mlima wa Galilaya, akatangasa Lilandu Maha lya Sapanga, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Akilonga, “Lipindi lihika kala, na unkosi wa Sapanga upabehi. Mleki sambi mumhyukile Sapanga na kuyitikila Lilandu Maha!” <verse eid="MRK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Lipindi Yesu pakawela akityanga mmbali mwa lihiwa Galilaya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:16">awawonili walopola waivili, Simoni na Andelea mlongu ghaki wangutanda homba kwa wafu.<figure style="fig" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" ref="1:16">Mundu angutanda homba kwa wafu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mnikovikeli, nenga nitewavula kuwayegha wandu handa walopola wanguyegha homba.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Palapala wakaleka nyafu zyao na kumkovikela. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu paayendelelili kuulongolo, akawalola Yakobu na Yohana</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:19">wana wa Zebedayu. Wakiwela mghati gha whatu wakihonjola nyafu zyao. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Yesu akawakema lipindi lilalila, na weni wakamleka tati ghao Zebedayu mghati gha whatu akiwela na watumikila ghaki, wakayenda kula kawela Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu mweni mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na wavulwa ghaki wakahika kumbwani Kapelinaumu, na bwitu paihikili lichuwa lya kupumulila, Yesu akayingila mlighuta lya kukonganika lya Wayahudi, akatumbula kuvula. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Wandu wogha wamyoghanilili walikangasilwi na mavula gha mweni kwaikiva awelile ng'ogha akivula handa wavula ghao wa ulaghilo ila handa mundu kawela na ukulu. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Saa hila, mundu mmonga akolilwi na lihoka mula mghati mwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:23">lighuta lya kukonganika lya Wayahudi. Akatumbula kutova lilowi, akilonga handa mundu avile na ukulu, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Kuwela na lilando liki paghati gha wenga na twenga, wenga Yesu wa Nazaleti? Uhika kutuyalamisa? Ningukumanya wenga ni ghani, wenga ni yula mhaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu akalikalipila hali lihoka akilonga, “Utami nuu, Uhuki kwa mundu hayu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Lila lihoka likamtikatika mundu yula kwa makakala, akatova</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:26">lilowi likamuhuka. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Wandu wogha walikangasili, wakakonyana,“Ni mighalu liki hai? Ghuli, ni mavulo gha hyonu? Mundu hayu kana uweso wa kuwapegha malaghilo mahoka, na weni wakamuyitikila!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Milandu gha Yesu ilandalili kwa kuloposela mahala kogha mu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:28">Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wandu watangala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayu 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Yesu na wavulwa ghaki wakahuka kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi, wakayenda mbaka ku ukaya kwa Simoni na Andelea. Na Yokobu na Yohanawakayenda pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Hinu nyongo mkwahanu wa Simoni, akiwela mkindanda anguvina nesu. Wakamlongela Yesu lipindi pahikili. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu akamyendela yula nyongo, akamkola liwoku, akamyinula. Hula uvina ukamlekesela, akatumbula kuwatelekela. <verse eid="MRK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Lumihi, lichuva palihongili kala, wakamyeghela Yesu wavina</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:32">wogha na wandu wakolilwi na mahoka. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Wandu wogha wa mmbwani hula walikungulili kuulongolo gha lighuta. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Mweni Yesu akawalamisa wandu watangala weni kuwela na mavina wekaweka, awawingili mahoka matangala, ila kawakanila mahoka kulonga chochosi kwaikiva wammanyili mweni ni ghani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutangasa ku mlima Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Kilau ghaki pambila na mhana, Yesu ahukili, akayenda mahala pawela ngʼogha na wandu kumyupa Sapanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na wayaki wakayenda kumhaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Pawamlolili, wakamlongela, “Kila mundu angukuhakula!”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu akawalongela, “Tuyendi kumimbwani ghangi gha pabehi. Nikawatangasile kula kangi, kwaikiva nihikili kwa hayi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Hinu, akayenda kila mahala kula mlima Galilaya akitangasa ku</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:39">malighuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi na kuwinga mahoka<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu mweni ukalawa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayu 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Mundu mmonga mweni kuwela na ukalawa amyendili Yesu, kamtundamila kwa manung'una, akamlongela, “Paupala, unguwesa kunighulula!” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu akamwonela luhungu, akalangiha liwoku lyaki, akamkola</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:41">na kumlongela, “Ningupala ghululiki!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Palapala ukalawa ukamleka mundu yula, akaghululika. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Hinu Yesu akamlongela ayendi zyaki na kumlongela, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Uloli ukotoho kumlongela mundu yoyosi lilando hali, ila uyendi ukajilangihi kwa mtambika na ukawapeghi litambiku kwaikiva kwa kuhululwa kwa wenga handa alaghilili Musa kuwahighilisa yiwa ulama.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ila mundu yula akayenda, akatumbula kulongela milandu hila kila milima na kulonga mighalu itangala hata Yesu kawesa ng'ogha kangi kuyingila kumbwani wowosi lipala, impalili kutama panji gha mlima, mahala pawela ngʼogha na mundu. Hata nagha, wandu wamhikilili kuhuma kogha kogha.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu ahovili vikongonu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayu 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Badili gha machuwa mayaghani, Yesu ahuyili kukapelinaumu, wandu wakamanya yiwa kawela ukaya. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Hinu, wakahika wandu watangala nesu wakamema mghati mwa lighuta na panji gha mahala gha kuulongolo gha lighuta. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Wandu wanjechi wakahika na wampapili mundu ahovili vikongonu wakamyegha kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ila kwaikiva gha lipinga lya wandu, wawesili ng'ogha kumyegha pabehi na Yesu. Hinu, wakapoyola limbandu lya paghala liwela kunani gha mahala kawela Yesu. Pawapatili kala mahala wakamghulusa yula mundu akiwela kawonja mlihinda. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu paalolili ukwinila ghao akamlongela yula ahovili vikongonu, “Mwana ghangu, ulekeselwa uhakata ghako.” <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Wavula wamonga wa laghililo wenikuwela watama pala</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:6">wakiwachila mumioyu ghao, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Ghuli anguwesa kulonga nagha? Angumlighu Sapanga! Kwa hela mundu anguwesa kulekisela uhakata ila Sapanga weka ghaki.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Bwitu Yesu amanyili mumpumulo ghaki yiwa kyani wangukiwachila kumioyu ghao, na akawakonya, “Kwa kyani mnguwachila vindu havi? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Kindu kyani kiwela kiyuyuu kumlongela mundu mweni vikongonu vihovili, ‘Uhakata ghako ulekeselwa’ au kumlongela, ‘Ugholoki, utoli lihinda lyaku utyangi’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Hinu, ningupala mmanyi yiwa Mwana wa Mundu kawela na ukulu wa kuwalekesela wandu uhakata kumlima wogha.” Pala akamlongela hayu mundu ahovili vikongonu, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Ningukulongela, ugholoki, utoli lihinda lyaku uyendi ukaya!” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Bahala wandu wogha wakimlola, yula mundu akitandamuka,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:12">akatola lihinda lyaki, akayenda. Wandu wogha walikangasili na kumyinula Sapanga, wakilonga, “Tuwesa ng'ogha kulola mighalu handa hai”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayu 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu ayendili kangi mmbali gha lihiwa Galilaya. Lipinga lya wandu likamyendela, na mweni akatumbula kuwavula. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Paawelile angutyanga mnjila, akamlola Lawi mwana wa Afayo, alikalili mlighuta lya kukungulila kodi. Yesu akamlongela, “Ungovekeli!” Lawi akagholoka akamkovikela . <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Kuulongolu, Yesu awelile kalikala, ukaya kwa Lawi, wangulyegha</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:15">mulyo.Wakungula kodi watangala na weni sambi wawelile wamkovekela Yesu na wamonga ghao wawelile walikala kumesa pamonga na mweni na wavulwa ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Hinu wavula wamonga wa laghilo wenikuwela Mafalisayo pawamlolile Yesu akilyegha pamonga na wandu wenikuwela na sambi na wakungula kodi, wakawakonya wavulwa ghaki, “Kwa kyani angulyegha pamonga na wakungula kodi na weni sambi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu pakawahyoghanila na akawalongela, “Wandu weni ukomu wangumpala ng'ogha mbuhi mlamisa, Wenikumpala ni wala weni uvina. Nihika ng'ogha kuwakema wandu wa maha, ila waghola sambi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha kuwopa kulyegha mulyo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayu 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Lipindi limonga wavulwa wa Yohanana wavulwa wa Mafalisayo wawelile wanguwopa kulyegha. Hinu, wandu wakahika, wakamkonya Yesu, “Kwa kyani wavulwa wa Yohanana wa Mafalisayo wanguwopa, ila wavulwa ghako wanguwopa ng'ogha?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ghuli weni kuhaghulwa kumhambu wa uposo wangupalwa kuwopa lipindi bambu wa uposo kawela pamonga na weni? Lipindi lyogha pawawela pamonga na bambu wa uposo wanguwesa ng'ogha kuwopa.” <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ila lipindi litehika pala bambu wa uposo atehumiswa paghati gha weni, lipindi hali ndiwa watewopa kulyegha mulyo.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Wandu wangudumula ng'ogha kipandi kya nguu gha hyonu na kukisonela kunguu ihakalili, Paikawela waghola nagha haki kipandi kya hyonu kitedumuka kuhila nguu ihakalili, na mahala pala peni kubaluka patebaluka nesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Wandu wangutaya ng'ogha divai ya hyonu kuvihaku vya ngosi vihakalili. Paikawela waghola nagha, divai itevibalula vila vihaku vya ngosi, na divai pamonga na vila vihaku vya ngosi vitebaluka. Divai gha hyonu ingutaywa kuvihaku vya ngosi hyonu!”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvula mghalu kunani gha lichuwa lya kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayu 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Lichuwa limonga lya Kupumulila, Yesu awelile angutyanga kumitawa gha mapemba. Pawawelile wangutyanga, wavulwa ghaki wakatumbula kudumula mihoji gha mapemba. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafalisayo wakamkonya Yesu, “Uloli kwa kyani wangughola mghalu upalwa ng'ogha kughola lichuwa lya kupumulila?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ghuli, msoma ng'ogha vila kaighola Daudi pamonga na wayaki lipindi pawawela na njala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Mweni ayingilili mghati mwa lighuta lya Sapanga, akalyegha hila Mibumunda ivikilwi kuulongolu gha Sapanga. Mghalu hau ugholilwi lipindi Abiasali kawela mtambika mkulu. Na ni watambika hela weni kuwela walekeselwa kulyegha mibumunda hila. Ila Daudi akalyegha, kangi akawapegha na wayaki.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Hinu, Yesu akawalongela, “Kupumlila kuvikilwi kwaikiva gha kuwatanga wandu na ng'ogha mundu kutanga kupumulila. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kwa nagha, Mwana wa Mundu kanauweso hata kwa Lichuwa lya kupumulila.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamiha mundu ahova liwoku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayu 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yesu ayingilili kangi ku lighuta gha kukokanganika na Wayahudi na mula mghati mvile na mundu avile na liwoku lihova. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Wandu wavile mula wangumlindila amlamisi mundu yula Lichuwa lya kupumulila ili wapali kumsitaki. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu akawalongela hayu mundu avile na liwoku lihova, “Uhiki baha kuulongolo.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Hinu akawakonya, “Kwa kulandana na malaghililo gha twenga niki tungudahilwa kughola,” au “kyani malaghililo gha twenga zingutulongela kughola?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Ila weni walongili ng'ogha lilando.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu akawakwenjulila mihu wogha kwa lilaka, moyu ukamluma kwa ikiva gha utatala wa mioyu ghao. Hinu akamlongela yula mundu, “Ulangihi liwoku lyaku!” Mweni akalilangihi liwoku lyake, likavile likomu kangi. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Lipindi lilalila Mafalisayo wakahuma panji, wakalikungula pamonga na wandu wa kipinga kya Helodi wakahaka njila gha kumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipinga lya wandu mmbali mwa lihiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu na wayitikila ghaki wakayenda mmbali mwa lihiwa lya Galilaya, na lipinga likulu lya wandu, kuhuma mlima Galilaya wakamkovekela, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />hila hila Yelusalemu, Idumea, kumwambu gha lweni Joludani, Tilo na Sidoni. Wandu wala watangala wamyendilili Yesu kwa ikiva gha kuyughanila mighalu itangala ivile kaighola. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Yesu akawalongela wayitikila ghaki wamvikili maha whatu imonga, ili lipinga lya wandu likotoho kumtindila. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Avile kawalamiha wandu watangala, na wavina wogha wavile wangumtindila ili wapati kumyavisa. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Wandu wavile na mahoka pawamlola Yesu, wakaguwa kuulongolu ghaki na kutova lilowi, wakilonga, “Wenga ni mwana wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ila Yesu akawakanyika kwa kuyoghoha wakotoho kulonga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:12">kwa wandu yiwa mweni ni ghani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahaghula wandumindumi ikumi na waivili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayu 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesu akwelili kukitumbi akawakema wala awapalili. Hinu, wakamyendela, <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Mweni akawahaghula wandu ikumi na waivili ikiva akawakema wandumindumi, walikali na mweni, awayeghi kutangasa <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na wavile na uweso wa kuwawinga mahoka. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Wala ikumi na waivili awahaghulili ni hagha: Simoni, Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:16">ampeghili lihina lya Petelo, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobu na mlongu ghaki Yohana, wogha waivili wavile wana wa Zebedayu, Yesu awapeghili lihina lya Boaneligi, limanyikana handa “Wana wa mlindimu,” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andelea na Filipu na Batolomayo na Matayu na Tomaso na Yakobu mwana wa Alifayu na Simoni mweni kaya wa Kaanani na <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Yudasi Isikaliyoti yula avile kamyuka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayu 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Hinu Yesu akahuya ukaya. Lipinga lya wandu wavile walikungula kangi, hata Yesu na wayitikila ghaki wapata ng'ogha lipindi lya mulyo, <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Walongu ghaki na wandu ghangi pawayughanilili mghalu hula wakahuka kuyenda kumtola kwa ikiva wangulonga “kana lukwali.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Na weni wavula wa ulaghililo wavile wahuma Yelusalemu, wakalonga, “kana lihoka, kangi, anguwawinga mahoka kwa likakala lya ukulu wa Belizebuli avile mkulu wa mahoka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Hinu Yesu akawakema, akawalongela kwa milandano, “Ghuli lihoka linguwesa kuliwinga lyeni?”<verse eid="MRK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Wandu wa Unkosi mmonga pawatovana na kulikala mapinga mapinga yangulipinga yeni kwa yeni, hinu Unkosi hula uteguwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Kangi ikiva walongu wamonga ikiva watepalaghanyika lipinga lipinga yangulipinga, walongu hagha wateyalamila. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ikiva hinu, ulongosi wa lihoka ukapalaghanyika mapinga mapinga unguwesa ng'ogha kuyendelela, ila uteyalamiswa nesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Kwahela mundu anguwesa kuvamila lighuta lya mundu mweni makakala na kumpokola hindu ghaki ila atumbuli kamuwopa yula mundu avile na makakala, baha ndiwa awesi kumpokola hindu ghaki.”<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Nenga ninguwalongela uchakaka, wandu watewesa kulekeselwa sambi ghao wogha na malighu ghao hyogha kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Ila mundu amlighili Mpumulo wa Sapanga atelekeselwa ng'ogha mahakata zyake, atewela na uhakata wa machuva yogha ng'ogha mwihu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu akalonga nagha kwaikiva wavile wangulonga, “Kana mahoka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyongo na walongu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayu 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nyongo ghake Yesu na walongu ghake wafikili pala. Wakawoloka panji, wamtumili mundu wa kumkema. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Lipinga lya wandu wavile walikala pala wakamtindila. Hinu, wandu wakamlongela, “Nyongo ghako na walongu ghako wakiva panji, wangukukema.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu akawayanga, “Nyongo ghangu na walongu ghangu ni ghani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Hinu akawalola wandu wavile wamtindila, akalonga, “Hagha ndiwa nyongo ghangu na walongu ghangu. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Mundu yoyosi mweni aghola yampalili Sapanga, hayu ndiwa mhaja ghangu na mhacha ghangu na nyongo ghangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mundu angukulila mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayu 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu akatumbula kuwavula kangi akiva mmbali gha lihiwa Galilaya. Lipinga likulu lya wandu wakamtindila mbaka akadahila kuyingila ku whatu na kulikala. Wandu wogha wavile wakalikala payumu, mmbali mwa lihiwa lya Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Yesu akawavula mighalu itangala kwa kutumila mlandano. Na akawalongela nagha ku mavulo ghaki,<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Mhyoghanile! Pavile mundu mmonga avile kayenda kukulila mbeyu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Paavile angumwagha mbeyu, ghangi, ziguwa mnjila, wambongu wakahika wakalyegha. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Zimonga ziguwa mmaganga pavile ng'ogha na muhanga utangala, zikalela kwa kuloposela kwa ikiva mhanga utangala ng'ogha. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Lijuwa palihomoka, zikalungula, na kwa ikiva mikigha ghaki ivile ng'ogha na makakala, zileleuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Zimonga ziguwa kumibiki gha mihomi, na yeni ikakula na kulitindila na zyeni zilela ng'ogha mulyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Zimonga ziguwa mu mhanga wa maha, zimela na kukula na kulela, monga mbeyu ikumi itatu, monga ikumi isita na zimonga imia.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Hinu akawalongela, “Mweni mapulikilo na ahyoghanile!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukasini lwa kuvula kwa kutumila mlandano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayu 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu pa avile weka ghake, na wayitikila ikumi na waivili wa Yesu pamonga na wamonga wa wandu wavile mmbalimbali ghaki pawavile weka ghao, wakamkonya awalongeli kumanyika kwa milandano hila. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu akawayanga, “Mwenga mgubutuliwa kumanya yahighilwi gha unduna wa Sapanga, ila wala wavile panji watelongelwa kila kindu kwa mlandano, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />ili, ‘Waloli unagha, ila wakotoho kulola. Wayughanile unagha, ila wakotoho kumanya. Lukasini, wakotoho kumhyukila Sapanga na kulekeselwa uhakata.’”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angughalambula mlandano wa mkulila mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayu 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yesu akawakonya, “Ikiva mmanya ng'ogha mlandano hau, ghuli mtemanya milandano ghangi? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mbeyu ikulilwa na mkulila mbeyu ni lilando lya Sapanda. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Wandu ghangi ni handa mbeyu iguwili mnjila, bahala waliyughanila lilando lya Sapanga, Lihyukana linguhika na kulihumisa ku mioyu ghao. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Wandu ghangi ni handa zila mbeyu ziguwili pavile na maganga. Lipindi waliyughanila hali lilando hulipokela kwa luheku. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ila linguwayingila ng'ogha na kuvika mikigha mghati ghao, huyendelela kwa lipindi hela. Lipindi uhakili au lung'ahi vihika kwa ikiva gha lila lilando, lipindi lilalila wangutwenyuka moyu. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Wandu ghangi ni handa zila mbeyu ziguwili kumibiki gha mihomi, hau ni mlandano wa wala wanguyughanila lila lilando, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Ila maghasu gha mlima wogha hau, lumatamata lwa hindu, na lumatamata ghangi vikiwayingila vingutindilatindila lila lilando liwela mghati gha weni na kulikanisa kulela matungula. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ila ghangi ni handa zila mbeyu zikulilwi kumhanga wamaha. Hagha uyughanila lila lilando, na kulipokela, wakalela matungula, ghangi ikumi itatu, ghangi ikumi isita na ghangi imia.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Limbamba ligubikilwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu akayendelela kuwalongela, “Ghuli, wandu wangukosa limbamba na kulivika mghati na kuligubika kwa ndeleko au kulivika pai gha kindanda? Ila! wangulivika kunani gha kindangawala. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Hinu, kindu chochose kihighilwi kitevikwa lipala, na kindu chochose kigubikilwi kitegubutulwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Mweni kuyughanila na ahyoghanile.” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu akawalongela kangi, “Mkali mihu haki mkiyughanila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:24">Ulaghilo hauhau unguutumila kwa wandu ghangi kulamula, Sapanga atetumila kulamula kwa wenga na kuyongeseka.” <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Mundu avile na hindu ateyongeswa, avile ng'ogha na hindu, hata kila kisokombi akikolili kitetolwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mbeyu ingumela na kukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Unkosi wa Sapanga ungulandana na mundu mmonga akulilili mbeyu ku litawa lyaki, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />kila lichuwa paawonja na kuyimuka na mbeyu zimela na kukamala. Ila amanya ng'ogha mbeyu zingumelaghuli. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Mhanga weni unguwesesa kumela kwa mbeyu kukula na kulela matungula, mtumbula huhumisa lihamba ling'enya, na kangi lihoji, na kumwihu mbeyu mghati mwa lihoji. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Lipindi mbeyu pa ukamala, mundu anguubena kwa kutendela nyengo, kwa ikiva ni lipindi lya kubena.”<figure style="fig" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" ref="4:29">Mundu angubena kwa mbopu</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mbeyu gha haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayu 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu akalonga kangi, “Tuulandanisi Unduna wa Sapanga na liki? Au tuulongele kwa mlandano ghani? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ni handa mbeyu gha haladali ivile ni sokombi nesu ipita mbeyu zyogha ingukulilwa ku mhanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ila pasikwetwa, ingumela na kuvile mbiki mkulunga kupita mibiki yogha gha kulitawa. Miputila ghaki inguvile mikulunga hata mbongu wanguwesa kuchenga vijaka ku miputila ghaki.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu awavulili wandu kwa milandano itangala ilandana na hai,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:33">kwa vila wawesa kumanya. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Kalongela ng'ogha chochosi na weni kwa kutotumila mlandano, ila pawavile pamonga na wayitikila ghaki weka ghao avile anguwagubutulila mighalu yogha.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguliponga liyegha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayu 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Lichuwa lilalila, lumihi, Yesu awalongile wayitikila ghake, “Tuhubuki, tuyendi kumwambu gha lihiwa,” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Hinu wakalileka lipinga lya wandu, wakayingila mghati mwa whatu Yesu atamili na kuhuka pamonga na mweni. Whatu ghangi zimkovekela pamonga. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Hinu liyegha litopehu likatumbula kuwumba, mawimbi ghakalipinga hila whatu hata likatumbula kumema masi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu avile upandi wa kuhyetu gha wh<figure style="fig" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" ref="4:37">Whatu ingutovwa na mawimbi</figure>atu, kawonja lughonu kasaghamila msaghamu, wayitikila ghaki wakamyimusa na kumlongela, “Mvula, ghuli, uloli ng'ogha twenga tungupala kuhwegha?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Hinu, akayimuka, akalikalipila lila liyegha na kuyalongela</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:39">mawimbi, “Uleki! utami nuu!” bahala liyegha likaleka, kukavile maha. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Badili gha hagha Yesu akawalongela wayitikila ghaki, “Ghuli mwambila ukwinila ng'ogha?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Weni wakatila nesu, wakatumbula kukonyana, “Hayu ni ghani?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:41">Hata liyegha na mawimbi vingumyitikila!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu mweni mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayu 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Hinu, Yesu na wayitikili ghaki wakahika kula kumwambu gha lihiwa lya Galilaya ku mlima wa Wagelasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Lipindi lilalila Yesu pahuluka mu whatu, mundu mmonga akolili na lihoka avile kahuma kumimambi, akakongana na mweni. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Mundu hayu avile angulikala mmambi, kwa hela mundu anguwesa kangi kumwopa kwa minyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Lipindi lyogha pa wamwopa kwa pingu na minyololo, ila pa wamwopa hudumula hila minyololo na kudumula dumula zila pingu, kwa hela mundu kawesa kumlemesa. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Pamuhi na uhiku atamili mmimambi na mmitumbi akitova lilovi na kulidumula dumula kwa maganga. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Pa amlolili Yesu kwa kutali, akamtuwilila, akamtundamila.<verse eid="MRK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Akatova lilowi likulunga, “Uwela na kyani na nenga, wenga Yesu mwana wa Sapanga avile kunani nesu? Kwa lihina lya Sapanga, ningukulongela ukotoho kunihakili.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Alongile nagha kwa ikiva Yesu avile kamlongela, “Lihoka, umuhumi mundu hayu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Hinu, Yesu akamkonya, “Lihina lyaku ghani?” Mweni akayanga, “Lihina lyangu pinga, kwaikiva twenga tutangala.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Hinu, akamluwa Yesu akotoho kuwawinga ghala mahoka ku mlima hula. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Bahala pabehi na mmosu gha litumbi kuvile na lipinga likulunga lya mighuluwe likihungwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Hinu wala mahoka wakamluwa “Utuyeghi kwa wala mighuluwe, tuwayingili.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu akawaleka wayendi, hinu wala mahoka wakamhuma, wakawayingila wala minguluwe, lipinga lyogha lya mighuluwe wavile ielufu ivili lihulukiti ikiva wakayenda wakadubukila mlihiwa lya masi. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Wandu wavile wanguhunga mighuluwe wakatuwa mbilu, wakatova lilowi kwa mghalu hula mmuji na mmitawa. Wandu wakahika kulola yahumilile.<verse eid="MRK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Wakamyendela Yesu, wakamlola yulayula mundu akolilwi na lipinga lya mahoka kalikala pahi, kavala nguu na maghala ghaki yamhuyilile, wakatila. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Wandu waulolile mghalu hula wakawalongela wandu ghangi mighalu imkolili yula mundu avile akolitwi na mahoka na mighalu gha wala mighuluwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Hinu, wakatumbula kumluwa Yesu awuki ku mlima ghao.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu pa avile angukwela ku whatu yula mundu avile na mahoka akamluwa ayendi pamonga na mweni.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ila Yesu akamkanila badili ghaki akamlongela, “Uyendi ukaya kwa walongu ghako, ukawalongeli mighalu mikulu Bambu kakugholela na vila kakuwonela luhungu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Hinu yula mundu akayenda, akatumbula kutangasa kula Dekapoli, imanyikana mlima uvile na mamuji ikumi, mighalu yogha Yesu amgholili, wandu wogha walikangasili.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa biti Yailo na mdala mmonga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayu 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu pa avile kahubuka kangi upandi wa ipili wa lihiwa Galilaya kwa whatu. Lipinga likulunga lya wandu wakalikungula kuulongolo ghake, mweni avile kagholoka mmbali gha lihiwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Hinu, akahika mmonga ghao mkulu wa lighuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi akemilwi Yailo. Paamwolile Yesu, akatova manung'una kuulongolu ghaki, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Akamluwa nesu, akilonga,“Biti ghangu mnung'una ni mvina pabehi na kuhova. Tuyendi pepayi, ukamvikile mawoku ghako apati kulama na kulikala.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Hinu, Yesu akahuka pamonga na mweni, wandu watangala nesu wamkovekela na kumtindila tindila pandi zyogha.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Mmonga ghao avile mdala mweni uvina wa ligholovela kwa lipindi lya machuva ikumi na ivili.<verse eid="MRK 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Mdala yula avile aghasikile nesu, kuwayendela mambuyi watangala. Na ikiva avile kayomolakala hindu ghaki yogha, kapokela ng'ogha kulama na kayendelela kuvina. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Na mweni avile kayughanila kala milandu gha Yesu, na hinu, akahika na kuyingila paghati gha lipinga lya wandu akayenda kuhyetu gha Yesu na kuyavisa nguu ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Kaghola nagha, ikiva alilongilile mweni, “Nikikola hela nguu ghaki, nitelama.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Paakola nguu gha Yesu, lipindi lilalila ligholovela likaleka, na mweni akalimanya kalama.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Bahala, Yesu akamanya yiwa makakala ghaki yamlamisa mundu. Hinu akaughalambukila hula upinga wa wandu, akaukonya, “Ghani akolili nguu gha nenga?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Wayitikila ghaki wakamyanga, “Ungulola lipinga lya wandu wangukutindila, ghuli ungukonya ghani mweni kukukola?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ila Yesu akayendelela kulola kogha na kogha pandi zyogha amloli yula kamghola nagha.<verse eid="MRK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Yula mdala, akimanya yamkolile, akajiyegha mweni akihihimila kwa holu, akalidanga pahi kuulongolo gha Yesu na kulongela unagha wogha. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu akamlongela, “Biti, ukwinila ghako ukulamiha. Uyendi kwa maheli, ligholovela ghako lilama kala!” <verse eid="MRK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu akali angulongela, wandu wakahika kuhumila ukaya kwa yula mkulu wa lighuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi, wakamlongela, “Biti ghako kahova kala kwa kyani kuyendelela kumghasa mvula?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ila, Yesu akapughanya milandu ghao, akamlongela yula mkulu wa lighuta gha kukonganika wayahudi, “Ukotoho kutila, ukwinili hela.”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu kamlekesela ng'ogha mundu yoyosi kulongosana na mweni ila Petelo na Yakobu na Yohanamlongu ghaki Yakobu. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Pawahika ukaya kwa yula mkulu wa lighuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi, Yailu, mweni Yesu akahyoghanila mang'ung'uliko, wandu wakilila na kulumbilila. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Akayingila mghati, akawalongela, “Ghuli mngutova lilovi na mang'ung'uliko na kulila? Mhinja kahwegha ng'ogha, kawonja hela” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ila weni wakamheka kwa kupughanya. Hinu, akawahumisa wogha panji, akawatola tati ghaki na nyongo ghaki yula mhinja na wala wayitikila ghaki wa itatu, wakayingila mkyumba avile yula mhinja.<verse eid="MRK 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu akamkola liwoku, akamlongela, “Talita, komu,” ikimanyika, “Mhinja, uyimuki.” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Palapala mhinja akagholoka, akatumbula kutyanga. Hayu mhinja avile na machuva ikumi na ivili. Pala wandu wa kalikangasa nesu.<verse eid="MRK 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ila Yesu akawakanila nesu, mkotoho kumlongela mundu yoyosi mghalu hau. Yesu akawalongela wampeghi hayu mhinja mulyo.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angukanilwa kula Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayu 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu akahuka pala akayenda ukaya ghaki, akikovekelwa na wavulwa ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Lichuwa lya kupumulila palihika, akatumbula kuvula ku mulighuta gha kukonganika. Wayahudi wandu watangala wamyughanilile wakakangaswa, wakakonya, “Apatili kugha mighalu hagha? Ni Mawachilo gha mahala ghani hagha apeghilwi? Kangi angughola ghuli makangaso hagha? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Hayu ng'ogha yula mhongola vindu vya mibiki, mwana wa Maliamu na mlongu ghao akina Yakobu na Yoseana Yudasi na Simoni? Wakakonyana wahacha ghaki ng'ogha wangulikala baha kwa twenga?” Hinu wakasindwa Kumkwinila.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu akawalongela,“Mlota wa Sapanga angutundamilwa mahala kogha ila angutundamilwa ng'ogha ku mlima ghaki, kwa walongu ghaki na ukaya ghaki”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yesu kaghola ng'ogha makangaso pala, ila awavikilile mawoku wavina wamayaghani, akawalamisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu alikangasili nesu kwa ikiva gha ukwinila ng'ogha wa weni.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu anguwahaghula wayitikila ikumi na waivili</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayu 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">hinu Yesu aviyendelelile vimuji vya pala vivile pabehi akiwavula wandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Awakemili wala wayitikila ikumi na waivili, akatumbula kuwayegha wavili wa vili, akawapegha uweso wa kuwavingavinga mahoka, <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Akawalongela, “Mkotoho kutola chochosi pa myenda ila mkongocho hela. Mkotoho kutola libumunda, ng'ogha mhaku, ng'ogha mapesa. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Mvali makobasi ila mkotoho kutola nguu gha nyongesa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Kangi akawalongela, “Kokosi mtepokelwa mulighuta, mkotoho kuhuka kuyenda ku maghuta ghangi mbaka lipindi lya kuhuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Mahala poposi pavile wandu watewakanila kuwapokela au kuwayughanila, muhuki pala na myapundi malifu mmaghulu gha mwenga handa ulangihi kwa weni.” <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Hinu, wakahuka, wakawatangasila wandu waleki uhakata.<verse eid="MRK 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Wawawingilile mahoka watangala, wakawapakala mahuta gha mizeituni wavina watangala, wakawalamisa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kihu kya Yohanambatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayu 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Hinu, Mnduna Helode pa ahyoghanila milandu hagha yogha, kwa ikiva ukulu wa Yesu uvile ulandala. Wandu wangi wavile wakilonga, “Yohanambatisa kahinduka kuhuma kwa wahwegha, ndiwa kwa ikiva makakala hagha yangughola lihengu mghati ghaki.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ila ghangi walongili, “Mundu hayu ni Eliya,” wandu ghangi wakalonga, “Ayu ni handa mmonga ghao walota liloto wala wa dahile.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ila Helode pa kayughanila milandu hila, akalonga, “Hayu ni Yohanambatisa! Yula nimdumulile mutu ndiwa kahinduka.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Pala dahile Helode mweni avile kalonga Yohanambatisa akolwi na kumuwopa ku lighuta lya wawopwa. Helode agholile nagha kwa ikiva Helode amposile mdala wa Filipo, mlongu ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yohanambatisaji avile kamlongela Helode, “Ng'ogha maha wenga kumtola mdala wa mlongu ghako.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Hinu, Helodia akamhyomela nesu Yohana, akapala kumkoma, awesi ng'ogha.<verse eid="MRK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Helode amtilile Yohanakwa ikiva kamanya yiwa Yohanani mundu wa maha na mkwilikihi, na vila akamgholokela. Helode apalile kumyoghanila Yohana, hata ikiva badili gha kumyoghanila, umtama munu nesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Lichuwa limonga, Helodia akahaka njila, Ivile mhambu wa kuwelekwa kwa Helode, Helode awagholile mhambu wanahota wa njengakaya, wakulu wa watova ngondo na vilongosi wa Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Hinu, biti ghaki Helodia akayingila, na kukina, akawahekelesa nesu Helode na wahenja ghaki. Nduna akamlongela hayu mhinja, “Uluwi chochosi ukipaliti na nenga nitekupegha.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kangi kamlapila, “Chochosi uteniluwa, nitekupegha, hata nusu gha unduna ghangu,” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Pala yula mhinja akahuka, akamkonya nyongo ghaki, “Niluwi kyani?” Na mweni akamyanga, “Mutu wa Yohana Mbatisa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Mhinja akamuhuyila Nduna mbilo akamlongela, “Ningupala unipeghi hinaa baha, mutu wa Yohana Mbatisa ku luselo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Nduna atamilile moyu nesu, ila kwa ikiva gha kilapu kyake, na kwa wala wahenja ghaki mmuhambu, kawesa ng'ogha kumkanila.<verse eid="MRK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Hinu, Nduna akamlongela mtova ngondo kuyegha mutu wa Yohana Mbatisa. Mtova ngondo akayenda, kumdumula Yohanamutu mula mlighuta gha wawopwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Akayegha mutu muluselo, akampegha mhinja na mweni mhinja akampegha nyongo ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Wayitikila wa Yohanapa wayoghanila lilando hali, wakayenda wakautola higha ghaki, wakasika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwapegha mulyo wandu ielufu itano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayu 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Wala wandumindumi wakahuya, wakalikungula kuulongolu gha Yesu, wakamlongela yogha wayaghola na kuvula. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu akawalongela, “Tuyendi weka yetu mbaka pahala kwa kujihigha mkapumulili mayaghani.” Alongilile nagha kwa ikiva kuvile na wandu watangala nesu wavile wanguhika baha na kuhuka hata Yesu na wayitikila ghaki mbaka wapatile ng'ogha njila gha kulyegha mulyo. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Hinu, wakahuka wakayenda weka ghao kwa whatu, wakayenda mahala pa kuhigha. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ila wandu watangala wawalolile wakiyenda, na weni wakawamanya. Hinu wamonga wahukili kwa maghulu ku kila mmbwani, wakalongola kuhika.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Lipindi Yesu pa aghuluka mghati gha whatu, Yesu akalola lipinga likulu nga lya wandu, akawawonela luhungu, kwa ikiva wavile handa kondolu wavile ng'ogha na mhungaji. Akatumbula kuwavula mihalu itangala. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Lipindi lya pamihi lipela kala. Hinu, wayitikila wakamyendela Yesu, wakamlongela, “Mahala baha ni pamwitu, na lijuwa linguhonga. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Mbaha uwatauli wandu wayendi mumatawa na vimuji vya pabehi, wakahemeli mulyo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ila Yesu akawalongela,“Muwapeghi mwenga mulyo.” Na weni wakamkonya, “Ghuli uloli ng'ogha itedahilwa tuvile na mapesa ngenju ili tuhemeli mibumunda, na kuwapegha mulyo?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu akawakonya, “Mvile na mibumunda mininga? Myendi mkaloli.” pa walolile kala, wakamlongela, “Kuvile mibumunda itano na homba wavili hela”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Hinu, Yesu akawalaghila wayitikila wawatamisi wandu wogha lipinga lipinga kumanyahi.<verse eid="MRK 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Na weni wakatama mapinga mapinga gha wandu imia na gha wandu ikumi itano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Hinu, Yesu akaitola hila mibumunda itano na wala homba wavili, akalola kunani kundumba, akavihighila, akaimetula mibumunda, akawapegha wayitikila ghaki na wayitikila ghaki wakawapegha wandu. Na wala homba waivili vila vila wakawapegha wogha. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Wandu wogha wakalyegha, wakayukuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Wakalokota vipandi vighighalile vya mibumunda na homba, wakamemesa vibeja ikumi na ivili. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Na weni walyeghili yila mibumunda wavile walumi ielufu itano,<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutyanga kunani gha masi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayu 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Palapala Yesu akawalongela wayitikila ghaki wakweli muwhatu, wakalongolile kuyenda Betisaida kumwambu gha lihiwa Galilaya, lipindi mweni angulitahula lipinga lya wandu. p <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Badili gha kuwatahula wandu akayenda kulitumbi kumyupa Sapanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Pa ihika lumihi, whatu ivile paghati gha lihiwa, na mweni avile weka ghaki ku mlima myumu. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Awalolile wayitikila ghaki wakighasika kutova pondu kwa makakala mu whatu kwa ikiva liyegha livile linguwaghuyisa kuhyetu, hinu pa ivile pabehi na kuchiya, Yesu akawahikila akityanga kunani gha masi, akighola handa anguwaleka. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ila pa wamwonile akityanga kunani gha masi, waliwachila ni upumuli wa wagogolo, wakatova lilowi. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Kwa ikiva wogha pa wamlolile wakatila nesu. Lipindi lilalila Yesu akalonga na weni, “Mtami nuu, ni nenga! Mkotoho kutila!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Hinu, akakwela muwhatu kuwavile, na liyegha likauleka. Weni wakalikangasa nesu, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Kwa ikiva wamanyili ng'ogha niki hula mkangaso wa kuwalyeghesa mibumunda wandu ielufu itano, kwa ikiva mahala ghao yavile yamanyili ng'ogha.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wavina kula Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayu 14:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Wahubukili lihiwa, wakahika mlima wa Genisaleti, wakasaghamisa whatu mmbali wakiwopa lughoi. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Pa waghululile mu whatu wandu wakammanya yiwa ni Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Hinu, kwa kuloposela wakatindila ku mlima hula wogha, wakatumbula kuwatola wavina wawonjili kunani gha mmihinda ghao, wakawayegha kila mahala pa wayughanila Yesu kabaha. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kila mahala Yesu ayendile, kimbwani na kumbwani, au mmitawa, wandu wawavikile wavina mahala pa lipala, wakamluwa nesu wakoli hata luviniku lya nguu ghaki. Na wala wogha wamkoliti wakalama.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mavulo kuhuma kwa mambuyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayu 15:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Wamonga wa Mafalisayo na Wavula wa ulaghililo wavile wakihuma Yelusalemu walikungulile kuulongolo gha Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Walolile wamonga wa wayitikila ghaki wakilyegha mulyo kwa mawoku ghao, kwa ng'ogha kughulula mawoku handa ipalilwi na ulaghilo wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Kwa ikiva Mafalisayo na Wayahudi wogha wangukola mavulo wayapokilile kuhuma kwa wagogolu wa weni. Walyegha ng'ogha mulyo mbaka waghululi mawoku mbaka mkihughulumbi maha. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Kangi, wangulyegha ng'ogha kindu chochosi kuhuma kusoku, mbaka kughulula mawoku. Vilavila na mavulo ghangi wapokelile kuhuma dahile handa vila kughulula vikombi na kivigha na kyombu kya shaba. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Hinu, Mafalisayo na wavula wa malaghililo wakamkonya Yesu, “Ghuli wayitikila ghako wakovikela ng'ogha mavulo tupokelile kwa wagogolu wa twenga, ikiva wangulyegha mulyo kwa mawoku gha kughulula ng'ogha”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu akawayanga, “Mngujighola wandu wamaha mwenga! Mlota Isaya alongile yaulongolo maha kwa mwenga handa ayandikile, Sapanga angulonga, ‘wandu hagha, wangutundamila kwa milandu hela, ila mmioyu gha weni, wavile kutali na nenga.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Kuyupa kwa weni ni kwa hela, ikiva mighalu wanguvula ni mavulo gha kiwandu hela handa vila ni mavulo gha sapanga.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Mwenga mnguleka malaghililo gha Sapanga na kukamula malaghililo gha wandu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Mwenga mngumanya kuhyeta kwa ukalamuka malaghililo gha Sapanga ili mkovekeli malaghililo gha mwenga.<verse eid="MRK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Kwa ikiva Musa alaghilile, ‘Muwatundamili tati ghako na nyongo ghako,’ ‘Na mundu amligha tati ghaki au nyongo ghaki, angudahilwa ahovi.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ila mwenga mnguvula, ‘Ikiva mundu avile na hindu kiewesa kumtanga tati ghaki au nyongo ghaki, akotoho kuwatanga na amyegheli Sapanga handa hupo, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Hinu, adahiliwi ng'ogha kangi kumtanga tati ghaki au nyongo ghaki.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Nagha mngupughanya lilando lya Sapanga kwa ikiva gha mavula mngupeghana. Kangi mngughola mighalu itangala gha nagha.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihalu imghola mundu akotoho kuwoneka maha kuulongolo gha Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayu 15:10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu aukemilili kangi hula upinga wa wandu, akawalongela, “Mniyoghanile wogha, mkamanyi. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kwahela kindu kinguyingila mghati gha mundu kuhuma panji ndiwa kingumghola mundu akotoho kudahilwa na Sapanga. Ila kihumili mghati gha mundu kyeni ndiwa kingumghola mundu akotoho kudahilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Mweni mapulikilo gha kuhyoghanila na ahyoghanile. <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Pa auleka hula upinga wa wandu na kuyingila mlighuta, wayitikila ghaki wakamkonya awalongeli hula mlandano ni kyani.<verse eid="MRK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Na mweni akawalongela, “Ghuli, hata mwenga mmanya ng'ogha? Ghuli, mmanya ng'ogha yiwa kindu kimyingila mundu kuhuma panji, kiwesa ng'ogha kumghola mundu akotoho kudahilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Kwa ikiva kimyingila ng'ogha mmoyu, ila mumtima, na kuulongolu huyeghwa mchowu?” Kwa kulonga nagha, Yesu kalekesela milyo yogha ni maha kulyegha. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Akayendelela kulonga, “Kihumilile mghati gha mundu ndiwa, kingumghola akotoho kudahilwa na Sapanga.<verse eid="MRK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kwa ikiva, mmoyu mwa mundu huhuma mawachilo mahakata na ungongola na uwihi na kukomana, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />Ughoni na umwimi na uhakata na uhwangi na lumatamata na wifu na malighu na ukwinakwina na usihisihi. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Mahakata hagha hyogha yahumila mghati gha mundu, na yeni yangumghola mundu akotoho kudahilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukwinila kwa nyongo mmonga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayu 15:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu ahukili pala, akayenda mlima uvile pabehi na Tilo. Haku kayingila ku lighuta monga na adaghilile ng'ogha mundu amanyi yiwa, kamula, ila iwesekana ngogha kwa mweni kujihigha. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Pala mdala mmonga avile na mwana mweni mahoka, ahyoghanilile milandu gha Yesu, hinu, akahika akatundamila kwa kutova manung'una kuulongolu ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Nyongo yula avile ng'ogha Myahudi, mweni kaya wa Silofoiniki. Akamluwa Yesu amhumisi mahoka biti ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ila Yesu akamyanga, “Uleki mtumbula wana wayukuti, kwa ikiva ng'ogha maha kutola mulyo wa wana na kuwadangila ghalu”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ila yula nyongo akalonga,“Ni nagha, Bambu; ila hata ghalu wavile pahi gha mesa hulyegha yasyelili gha wana”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu akamlongela, “Kwaikiva uyanga nagha, uyendi ukaya ghako. Lihoka limhuka kala mhinja ghako.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Hinu, yula mdala akayenda ukaya ghaki, akamlola mwana kawonja mkindanda, na lihoka lihumilile kala.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mweni kigugumila kikalipa na majogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Hinu Yesu akahuka kula ku mlima uvile pabehi na Tilo na akapitila Sidona na paghati gha Dekapoli kumanyika mlima uvile na mamuji ikumi na hata akahika ku lihiwa lya Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Wakamyeghela mundu mmonga avile majogo na kigugumila kikalipa hilahila. Wala wamyeghiti wakamluwa Yesu amvikili mawoko. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Hinu Yesu amuhumisilile yula mundu paghati gha lila lipinga, akayenda na mweni mahala kutali mayaghani, akamvika vyala ghaki mmapulukilo, akahunya mata na kumyavisa lulimi kwa mata yala. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Hinu Yesu akalola kunani kundumba, akapumula kwa makakala na kumlongela yula mundu,“Ifata” Ingumanyika,“Wopoleka.” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Bwitu mapulikilo ghaki ghakawopoka, na lulimi lwake lukalelehuka, akatumbula kulonga maha.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu akawalongela wakotoho kumlongela mundu lilando lila. Ila kwa vila awakanilile ndiwa wayendilelile kulongela lilando lila. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Wandu wogha walikangasilile nesu, wakalonga, “Agholile yogha maha, amewapegha majogo kuyughanila, na wangali kulonga wakalonga.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwapegha mulyo wandu ielufu inne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayu 15:32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ku machuwa ghala, lipinga likulunga lya wandu walikunguliti kangi na wavile ngʼogha na mulyo. Yesu akawakema wayitikila ghake, na kuwalongela, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Ninguwawonela luhughu wandu hagha kwa ikiva wavile na nenga kwa machuwa itatu, wavile ngʼogha na mulyo. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nikiwaleka wayendi ukaya na njala wakiva mnjila watehyunga kwa njala, kwa ikiva wamonga ghao wahumilile kutali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Wayitikila ghaki wakamkonya, “Baha mmwitu tutetola kugha mibumunda gha kuwayukutisa wandu hagha wogha?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu akawakonya, “Mvile na mibumunda mininga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Wakamyanga, “Tuvile na mibumunda isaba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Hinu, akawalongela wandu watami pahi. Akaitola yila mikati isaba, akamhighila Sapanga, akaimetula, akawapegha wayitikila ghaki wawapeghi wandu, na weni wakawapegha. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Vilavila wavile na vihomba vimayaghani. Yesu akavihighila, akalonga muwapeghi wandu hilahila. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Wandu wakalyegha, wakayukuta. Wakakungula vihighalile wakamemesa vibeja isaba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Na weni walyeghilile wavile wandu ielfu inne, Yesu akawatahula. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Lipindi lilalila akakwela mu whatu pamonga na wayitikila ghaki, akayenda mmuji wa Dalimanusa.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wangupala Kilangihi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matayu 16:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Wamonga wa Mafalisayo wakahika wakatumbula kulongelana na Yesu kwa kumyesa, wakampala agholi makangaso kulangiha yiwa uwesa ghaki uhuma kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu alolile luhungu mmoyu ghake akalonga, “Ghuli kiwelekwa haki kingupala makangaso? Unagha ninguwalongela, kiwelekwa haki kitepeghwa ng'ogha makangaso yoyosi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Hinu akawaleka, akayingila kangi mghati gha whatu, akatumbula mwanja kuyenda mwambu gha ipili gha lihiwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilungu gha Mafalisayo na Helodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayu 16:5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Wayitikila ghaki wavile waliwasuwa kutola mibumunda, wavile na lbumunda mmonga hela ku whatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mliloli maha nesu, mlikali weka na chilungu kya mafalisayu na chilungu kya Helodi.”ʼ <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Wayitikila ghaki wakatumbula kulongelana weni kwa weni, “Angulonga nagha kwa ikiva tuvile ngʼogha na mibumunda.”ʼ<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu akamanya malongelano ghala, akawalongela, ghuli mngulongelana kwa kuvila ngʼogha na mibumunda? Ghuli, mmbila mmanya ng'ogha? Ghuli mioyu ya mwenga ni mitopehu?<verse eid="MRK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ghuli, mvile na mihu na mlola ngʼogha? Mvile na mapulukilo na mngalikuyughanila? Ghuli, mkumbuki ngʼogha? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Lipindi lila panimetula hila mibumunda itano na kuwapegha wandu ielfu itano? “Mkungulile vibeja vininga vya vihighalile.” Wakamyanga, “Ikumi na ivili.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Na panimetula hila mibumunda isaba na kuwapegha wandu ielufu inne, mkungulile vibeja vininga vya vihighalile? “Wakamyanga, Isaba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Hinu, akawakonya, “Mmbila, mmanya ngʼogha?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu angalimihu wa Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu ahikilile ku Betisaida pamonga na wayitikila ghaki. Kula wandu wakamyeghela angalimihu, wakamluwa amyavisi.<verse eid="MRK 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu akamkola yula angalimihu liwoku, akamyegha panji gha kimbwani. Akamuhunyila mata ku mihu, akamvikila mawoku kumihu, akamkonya, “Ghuli, unguwesa kulola kindu?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Yula angalimihu akalola, akalonga, “Ninguwalola wandu wawoneka handa mibiki ingutyanga.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Hinu Yesu akamvikila kangi mawoku ghaki ku mihu gha yula mundu, na mweni akakwinjula mihu maha. Mihu ghaki ilamile, na kuwesa kulola vindu vyogha lipalalipala.<verse eid="MRK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu akamlongela ayendi ahuyi ukaya ghaki, akimlaghila “Hata ukotoho kutyangatyanga ku kimbwani baha.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angulonga lipala Yesu yiwa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayu 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Hinu, Yesu na wayitikila ghake wayendile pabehi na vimbwani vya Kaisalea Filipi. Pa wavile mnjila Yesu awakonyile wayitikila ghake, “Wandu wangulonga nenga ni ghani?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Wakamuyanga, “Ghangi wangulonga yiwa wenga ni Yohana Mbatisa na ghangi Elia na ghangi mmonga wa walota.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Na mweni akawakonya, “Na mwenga ghuli, mngulonga nenga ni ghani?” Petelo akamyanga, “Wenga ndiwa kilisito ahaghulilwi na Sapanga kuvile Mnduna.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Hinu Yesu akawalaghilila, “Mkotoho kumlongela mundu yeyose lilando hali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongela milandu gha kuhova na kuhinduka kwa mweni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayu 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Hinu, Yesu akatumbula kuwavula wayitikila ghaki, akilonga, “Ingudahilwa mwana wa Mundu ahakilwe na kukanilwa na wagholokela wa wandu, wakulu wa watambika pamonga na wavula wa ulaghililo. Atehova na machuwa gha itatu kuulongolo atehinduka.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Mweni awalongelile milandu hila lipala lipala. Hinu Petelo akamkema Yesu mmbali akatumbula kumkalipila. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ila Yesu akaghalambuka na kuwalola wayitikila ghaki na kumukalipila Petelo akilonga, “Uhuki baha pabehi na nenga wenga lihoka, kwa ikiva mawachilo ghako ngʼogha gha Sapanga ni gha kimundu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Hinu akalikema lipinga lya wandu pamonga na wayitikila ghaki akawalongela, “Ikiva mundu yoyose angupala avile myitikila wa nenga, akotoho kujigholela mihalu ghakimweni, ila atole lipingika lyaki anikovekeli.<verse eid="MRK 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kwa ikiva mundu apalile kuulokola ukomu ghaki, ateulamisa, ila mundu ayalamisile ukomu ghaki kwa ikiva gha nenga na kwa ikiva gha Lilandu lya Maha, atehuka kuhuma mu uhakata. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ghuli, Mundu atepokela nyongesa ghani ikiva atepokela vindu vyogha vya mlima wogha, ila akayalamisa ukomu ghaki? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Kwahela kindu unguwesa kuvika badili gha ukomu <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Mundu yoyose kukiwelekwa haki kihakata kivile ng'ogha na ukwinila kwa Sapanga, yula aniwonela honi nenga na mavula ghangu, Mwana wa Mundu atemwonela honi mundu yula, lipindi pahika Ukulu wa Tati ghaki pamonga na watumikila wa Sapanga wa kundumba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu akayendelela kuwalongela, “Uchakaka ninguwalongela, wavile wamonga paghati mwa mwenga baha wavile wateuhwegha ngʼogha pambila gha kuulola unduna wa Sapanga ukihika kwa ukulu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angughalambuka wuso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayu 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Kuyetu gha machuwa isita, Yesu awatolile petelo na Yakobu na Yohanana kuwayegha ku litumbi litali weka ghao. Na kula uwuso gha Yesu ukaghalambuka mbulete pee kuulongolu ghao,<verse eid="MRK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />nguu zyake sikaghalambuka mbulete pee na kung'ala ng'ala, ng'ogha ku mlima wogha mchenga wa kuwesa wakughola vila. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kangi wala wayitikila waitatu wakawalola Eliya na Musa wakilongelana na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petelo akamlongela Yesu, “Mvula ni maha twenga tutami baha. Hinu mbaha tuchenge vibimilo viitatu kimonga kyako na kimonga kya Musa na kimonga kya Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petelo na wayake watilili hata kamanya ng'ogha lya kulonga. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Hinu likahumila lihindu likawagubika, na lilowi likayoghanilwa kuhuma paghati pa lila lihindu, “Hayu ni Mwana ghangu nimpalile, mumyoghanile,”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Lipindi lilalila wayitikila wala pawalolile, wamwonilile ngʼogha mundu ghangi, ila Yesu weka ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Hinu, pa wavile wanguhuluka mndumba, Yesu akawakanisa wakatoho kumlongela mundu yeyose mighalu wailolile, mbaka Mwana wa Mundu atehinduka.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Hinu, wakakola lilaghililo lila, ila wakilongelana weni kwa weni “Kuhinduka ni ghuli?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Wakamkonya Yesu, “Ghuli wavula wa ulaghililo wangulonga, ingupalwa Eliya atumbuli kuhika?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Mweni akawayanga, “Hina, Eliya atetumbula kuhika kuyavika maha yogha. Hata nagha, kwa kyani iyandikwa ku mayandiko Makulu yiwa Mwana wa Mundu atekolwa na mahakilo yatangala na kupughanyilwa?<verse eid="MRK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ila ninguwalongela, Eliya kahika kala, na weni wakamgholela handa mayandiko yangulonga, kwa mweni.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mwana avile na mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayu 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Pa wahuyili kwa wayitikila ghangi, waliwonile lipinga likulunga lya wandu liwatindila. Wamonga wavula wa ulaghililo wavile wangulongelana na weni. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Bwitu wandu pa wamlolile Yesu, wogha walikangasile nesu, wakamtuwilila wamjambusi. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu akawakonya, “Mngulongelana kyani na weni?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Baha mundu mmonga mu lila lipinga lya wandu akamyanga, “Mvula, nimyegha mwana ghangu kwa wenga, akiva na lihoka amgholile akotoho kulonga. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Paamuhikila angumvamila, na kumguwisa pahi na kumghola ahumwi na mifulufulu mumlomu, akihyagha malino na kuwela kukangamala higha yogha. Niwaluwili wayitikila ghako wamhumisi hayu lihoka ila wawesa ngʼogha.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mwenga kiwelekwa kivile ng'ogha na ukwinila. Nitelikala na mwenga mbaka ligha? Niwapapa mbaka ligha? Mumyeghi kwa nenga.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Wakamyegha kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Lipindi lilalila yula lihoka paamwonili Yesu, akamtaya mwana kihinduhindu, na mwana akaguwa pahi, akaghalahuka na kuhumisa lifulufulu mumlomu. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu akamkonya tati wa yula mwana, “Akolilwi na mighalu hagha kuhuma ligha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Mweni akamyanga, “Kuhuma uwana ghaki.” <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />“Na lipindi kwa lipindi lihoka hali lingumguwisa mulyoto na mmasi, ili limyalamise nesu. Hinu, ikiva unguwesa, utuwoneli luhungu na kututanga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu akamlongela, “Kwa niki ungulonga, ‘Yiwa unguwesa?’ Yogha yanguwesekana kwa yula avile na ukwinilo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Pala yula tati akalila kwa lilowi, “Ningukwinila. Ila ukwinila wa nenga ukwila ng'ogha, undangi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu pa alilolile lipinga lya wandu linguyongeseka kwa kuloposela kuulongolo ghaki, akalikalipila lila lihoka, “ Lihoka umgholayi hayu mwana akotoho kulonga na majogo ningukulongela umhuki mwana hayu na ukotoho kumyingila kangi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Baha lila lihoka likatova lilowi, likamguwisa yula mwana pahi, hinu likamhuka. Mwana awonekanili handa Kahova, hata ghangi walongile, “Kahova”<verse eid="MRK 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ila Yesu akamkola liwoku yula mwana mlumi, akamyinula, na mweni akagholoka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Hinu, Yesu paayingilile ukaya, wayitikila ghaki wakamkonya kwa kuhigha, “Kwa kyani twenga tuwesili ngʼogha kumhumisa hayu lihoka?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Na Yesu akawalongela, “Lihoka lya nagha liwesa ngʼogha kuhumiswa ila kwa kuyupa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulonga kangi mghalu gha kihu kyaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayu 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na wayitikila ghake wahukile pala, wakayendelela na mwanja kupitila mlima gha Galilaya. Yesu apalile ng'ogha wandu wamanyi ka kugha, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Kwaikiva avile anguwavula wayitikila ghaki. Awalongilile, “Mwana wa Mundu ateyeghwa kwa wandu wavile watemkoma, ila lichuwa lya itatu badili gha kukomwa atehinduka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ila wavulwa ghaki wamanyili ng'ogha mghalu hula. Ila wakatila kumkonya.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghani avile mkulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayu 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Pawahikili Kapelnaumu na kuyingila mghati mlighuta, Yesu akawakonya wavulwa ghaki,“Mvile mngulongelana kyani munjila?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ila weni wanyamalili, kwaikiva kunjila wavile wakisindana yiwa ni ghani avile mkulu paghati gha weni. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu akatama pahi, akawakema wala wayitikila ghaki ikumi na ivili, akawalongela, “Mundu pa apalili kuvile wa mtumbula angupalwa avile wa mwihu na mnjaghila wa wogha.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Hinu akamtola mwana mnung'una, akamgholosa paghati ghao, akamkusikila, akawalongela, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Yula ampokelili mwana handa hayu kwa lihina lya nenga, angunipokela nenga na yula ambokela nenga, ambokeli nenga weka, ila angumpokela yula aniyeghili.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Avile ngʼogha mhakata wa twenga ni wa lipinga lya twenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohanaakamlongela, “Mvula, tumlolili mundu mmonga akihumisa lihoka kwa lihina lyako na twenga tuyesili kumkanila kwa ikiva mweni ng'ogha mmonga paghati mwa twenga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Ila Yesu akalonga, “Mkotoho kumkanila, kwa ikiva kwahela mundu angughola makangaso kwa lihina lya nenga, na baha pala akawesa kulonga mahakata gha nenga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Kwa ikiva yula atungingama ngʼogha twenga, avile upandi wa twenga. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Mundu yoyose atewapegha kikombi kya masi gha kunywegha, kwa ikiva mwenga ni wandu wa Kilisito, ateleka ng'ogha kupokela hupo ghaki.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyeswa kughola uhakata</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayu 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Yoyose atemghola mmonga wa hagha wanung'una wanikwinila, ni mbaha mundu hayu kuwopelwa ku ntandala mwa mweni liganga likulunga gha kuhyagila na kudangwa mbahali.” <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ikiva liwoku lyako likikughola ugholi uhakata, ulidumuli. Mbaha kuyingila ku ukomu na liwoku limonga ng'ogha. Ni mbaha kwa wenga kuyingila ku ukomu ukiva na liwoku limonga badili gha kuvile na miwoku mivili na kuyenda ku lyoto lijimika ngʼogha. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Mula kuvile na hunyi wawesa ng'ogha kuhova, na lyoto lijimika ngʼogha. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Ikiva lighulu lyako likughola ugholi uhakata, ulidumuli. Ni mbaha kwa wenga kuyingila ku ukomu wa nagha ukiva na lighulu limonga, badili gha kuvile na maghulu maivili na kudangwa ku lyoto lya ku lyoto lijimika ngʼogha. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Mula kuvile na hunyi wawesa ng'ogha kuhova, na lyoto lijimika ngʼogha. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ikiva lisu lyako pa likughola ugholi uhakata ulitupule. Ni mbaha wenga kuyingila ku unduna gha Sapanga ukiva na lisu limonga, badili gha kuvile na malisu maivili na kudangwa ku lyoto lijimika ngʼogha. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Mula kuvile na hunyi wawesa ng'ogha kuhova, na lyoto lijimika ngʼogha. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Kwa ikiva kila mmonga atevikwa munyu kwa lyoto.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Munyu ni maha, ila pa iyalamika, unogha ghaki, itevikwa kyani ili iwese kuvile munyu kangi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">Mvile na munyu mghati mwa mwenga na mlikali pamonga kwa uyitikila.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angukonywa mghalu gha kulekana na kuposana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayu 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu ahukili pala akayenda mbwani Yudasia, hata ku mwambo gha lweni lwa Joludani. Lipinga lya wandu likamyendela kangi, na mweni akawavula kangi handa aigholile.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Hinu, Mafalisayo wakamyendela, na kwa kumyesa wakamkonya, “Ghuli, malaghililo yangumlekelela mlumi kumleka mdala ghaki?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu akawayanga, “Musa awapeghilile malaghililo ghani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Na weni wakalonga, “Musa atulaghilili mlumi kumyandikila lihamba gha kulekana na kumpegha mdala ghaki na amleki.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu akawalongela, “Musa awayandikilili lilaghilo hali kwa ikiva gha utatala wa mitima gha mwenga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ila kahuma kuwumbwa kwa mlima wogha, Sapanga awumbili mlumi na mdala. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Hinu mlumi “Atemleka tati ghaki na nyongo ghaki na mweni atekongana na mdala ghaki.” <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Na weni wavili watevile higha imonga. Kwa nagha weni ng'ogha wavili kangi ila ni higha imonga. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Hinu, “Akikonganisili Sapanga, mundu akotoho kukilekanisa.” <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Pawayingilili kangi mghati mwa lighuta, wayitikila ghaki wakamkonya kwa lilando lila.<verse eid="MRK 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu akawalongela, “Na yula amleka mdala ghaki na kuposa mdala ghangi, angughola ngongola. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Hilahila, kila mdala amlekilili mlumi ghaki na kutolwa na mlumi ghangi angughola ngongola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahighila wana wanung'una</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayu 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Wandu wamyeghilili Yesu wana wanungʼuna ili awayavisi, ila wayitikila ghaki wakawakalipila. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu Pa alolili nagha, ayomilili akawalongela, muwaleke wana wahiki kwa nenga, mkotoho kuwakanila kwa ikiva Ufalumi wa Sapanga ni kwa wandu handa wana hagha. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ninguwalongela unagha, “Ikiva mundu yoyosi aupokela ng'ogha Unduna wa Sapanga handa wana wanung'una ateyingila ng'ogha hamu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Hinu akawapokela wana wala na kuwakumbata akawavikila mawoko kwa kuwahighila.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu avile na hindu itangala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayu 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu pa atumbulili mwanja ghaki, mundu mmonga akamuhikila akitula mbilo, akitova manungʼuna kuulongolo ghaki, akamkonya, “Mvula maha, nighole kyani ili niwese kulihi ukomu wa machuwa yayendelela?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu akamyanga, “Ghuli ungunikema mmaha? Kwa hela mundu avile maha ila ni Sapanga weka ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Unguyamanya malaghililo: ‘Ukotoho kughola ngongola, ukotohu kukoma wandu, ukotohu kuhija, ukotoho kungupikiha uhwangi, ukotoho kuzyanga, uwatundamili tati ghako, nyongo ghako.’” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Na mweni akamyanga, “Mvula, hagha yogha niyagholakala</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:20">kuhuma usongolo ghangu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu akamlola, akampala, akamlongela, “Ulepelelili na kindu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:21">kimonga. Uyendi ukawuse kila kindu ukolili, uwapeghi wandu wavile na hindu ngʼogha hazi mapesa, na wenga utevile mundu mweni vindu ngoo kundumba, hinu uhiki na kunikovekela.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ila msongolo yula pa ahyoghanilili milandu hila, aliholili, na kujiyendela mawachilo ghaki yakiva yayaghanika, kwa ikiva avilili mundu avile na mbia nesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu akalola kogha na kogha, akawalongela wayitikila ghaki,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:23">“Ni utatala wandu wavile na hindu ngoo kuyingila ku Unduna wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Wayitikila wakangasitwi na milandu ghaki. Yesu akawalongela</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:24">kangi, “Wana wa nenga, ni utatala nesu kuyingila ku Unduna wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ni yuyughu nesu likokolo walikema ngamia kuyingila ku kilanga kya sindanu, kupita mundu avile na hindu ngoo kuyingila ku Unduna wa Sapanga.” <figure style="fig" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" ref="10:25">Ngamia</figure> <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Wayitikila ghaki wakangasitwi nesu wakakonyana, “Ni ghani</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:26">nagha anguwesa kulokolwa?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu akawakwenjulila mihu, akawalongela, “Kwa mundu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:27">iwesekana ng'ogha, ila kwa Sapanga ngʼogha nagha, kwa ikiva kwa Sapanga yogha yanguwesekana.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petelo akamkonya, “Twenga tuleka yogha, tukakukovekela</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:28">wenga.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu akalonga, “Nagha ninguwalongela, kila mundu alekilili</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:29">lighuta ghaki, au mlongu ghaki, au mhaja ghaki, au nyongo ghaki, au tati ghaki, au wana au matawa kwa ikiva gha nenga na kwa ikiva gha lilando maha. <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />Atepokela mianja imia nesu lipindi hali lya hinaa. lighuta na mlongu na mhaja na nyongo na wana na matawa pamonga na mahakili na ku lipindi lya kuulongolo atepokela ukomu wa machuwa yogha ng'ogha kuyomoka. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ila watangala ghao wavile wa mtumbula watevile wa mwihu, na wavile wa mwihu watevile wa mtumbula.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulonga mihanja gha itatu kwa kihu na uhinduki ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayu 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu na wayitikila ghaki wavile mu njila, wakikwela kuyenda Yelusalemu, mweni akalongola kuulongolo gha weni. Wayitikila wakakolwa na holu, na wandu wavile kuyetu watilili. Yesu akawatola kangi wayitikila ghaki ikumi na ivili, na kutumbula kuwalongela mighalu itemkola. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Akawalongela, “Tungukwela kuyenda Yelusalemu na kula Mwana wa Mundu atehumiswa kwa wakulu wa matambiku na kwa wavula wa ulaghililo. Na weni watemlamula ahuweghi na kumyegha ku mawoku gha wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Na weni watempughanya, watemhunyila mata, watemtova hyatu na kumkoma. Ila ku lichuwa lya itatu atehinduka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu na Yohanawanguyegha liluwo ku Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayu 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Hinu, wana waivili wa Zebedayo, wala Yakobu na Yohana, wakamhikila Yesu na kumlongela, “Mvula, tungudahila utugholeli lilando tutekuluwa.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu akawakonya, “Mngudahila niwagholeli niki?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Na weni wakamyanga, “Pala utetama ku kikalilo kyako kikulu kya Unduna tungukudahila utami pamonga na twenga upandi ghako wa kulihila na ghangi upandi wa shotu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mmanya ngʼogha mukiluwa! Ghuli, mnguwesa kuhakika kwa njila handa nenga nitehakika? Au mtevile maha kuhwegha handa nitehwegha?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Na weni wakamuyanga, “Tunguwesa.” Yesu akayendelela kuwalongela, “Unagha mnguwesa kuhakika handa nitehakika, na kuhwegha handa nitehwegha. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Ila ni ghani atetama kulihila au shoto kwa nenga si lihengu lya nenga. Ni Sapanga weka hela atewavika wandu ku mahala pala awavikilili maha.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Wayitikila ghangi ikumi pa wayoghanila hagha, watumbulili kuwahyomela Yakobu na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Hinu, Yesu akawakema akawalongela, “Mngumanya yiwa wala wanguwachilwa kuvile vilongosi wa mamilima huwalongosa wandu ghao kwa makakala, na wakulu hagha huwagholesa lihengu handa wahusutu ghao. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ila kwa mwenga ikotoho kuvile nagha, ila adahila kuvile mkulu paghati mwa mwenga, angudahilwa avile mundu wa kuwatumikila mwenga. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Mundu yeyose adahilili kuvile Mkulu angudailwa, avile anguwatumikila wogha. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kwaikiva Mwana wa Mundu kahika ngʼogha kutumikilwa, ila kutumikila, na kuhumisa ukomu ghaki kwa kuwakombola wandu watangala.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa Batimayu mundu angalikulola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayu 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Hinu wakahika Yeliko, na mweni Yesu pa avile anguhuka ku mlima hula akiva na wayitikila ghaki pamonga na upinga mkulunga wa wandu, angalimihu, mwana gha Timayu akemilwi Batimayu, avile kalikala mmbali gha njila, anguluwaluwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Batimayu paayughanilili yiwa ni Yesu wa Nazaleti avile angutyanga mahala baha, atumbulili kutova lilowi, “Yesu, mwana wa Daudi, uniwoneli luhungu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Wandu watangala wakamkalipila na kumlongela alikali nuu, ila mweni akayendelela kutova lilowi, “Mwana gha Daudi, Niwoneli luhungu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu akagholoka, akalonga, “mumkemi.” Hinu wakamkema yula angalimihu, wakamlongela, “Ujigahili moyu. Ugholoki, angukukema.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Batimayu akaidanga nguu ghaki, akajumba kwa kuloposela na kumyendela Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu akamkonya, “Ungupala nikugholeli kyani?” Hayu angalimihu akamlongela, “Mvula, ninguluwa mbati kulola.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu akamlongela,“Uyendi ukwinila ghako ukulamisa,” Lipindi lilalila yula angalimihu akawesa kulola, akamkovekela na kuyenda pamonga na Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyingila Yeslusalemu kwa Luheku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayu 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Pawavile pabehi na Yelusalemu wahikili mmbwani wa Betifage, na Betaniya, pabehi na Litumbi lya Mizeituni. Baha akawalaghila waivili wa wavulwa ghaki, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />akawalongela, “Myendi ku kimbwani kivile kuulongolo kwa mwenga. Mtekuvile mkiyingila mula, mtelola mwana punda awopilwi, ikiva yambila kagholeswa lihengu ng'ogha na mundu. Mumwoposoli na mumyeghi baha.” <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ikiva mundu akiwakonya, Ghuli mngughola nagha? Mlongeli, “Bambu angumpala na atemuhuyisa baha lipindi halihali.” <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Hinu, wakayenda wakamlola mwanapunda mumnjila awopilwi mu mlyango wa lighuta. Pawavile wakimuwoposola, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Wandu wavile pala wakawakonya, “Mngughola kyani? Kwa kyani mngumuwoposola mwanapunda hayu?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Wayitikila wakayanga handa Yesu avile kawalongela, na weni wakawaleka wayendi zyao. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Wakamuyeghela Yesu yula mwanapunda. Wakagubika nguu zyao kunani kwa yula mwanapunda na Yesu akatama kunani ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Wandu watangala wakagubika nguu zyao ku njila na ghangi wagubikili viputila gha mibiki wadumulili ku matawa ghao. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Wandu wogha walongololili na wala wa kuyetu, wakatova lilowi na kulonga, “Ayinulwi! Ahighiliwe hayu ahika kwa lihina lya Bambu! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Sapanga uhighili Unduna uhika kuulongolo wa tati wa twenga Daudi. Ukwilikihi kwa Sapanga avile mkulu nesu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu akahika ku Yelusalemu na kuyingila mghati gha lighuta gha Sapanga. akalola kila kindu kwa maha. Ila ivile kala lumii, akayenda Besania pamonga na wala ikumi na ivili.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulapila mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayu 21:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Kilau ghaki, Pa wavile wanguhuma Besania, Yesu alumilwi na njala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Hinu, akalola kwa kutali mtini uvile na mahamba yatangala. akauyendela ili alole yiwa uwela na litungula lolose. Pa auhikilili, akaulola uvile ngʼogha na litungula lolose ila mahamba weka hela, kwa ikiva ivile ngʼogha lipindi lyake lya kuweleka matungula. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Pala akaulongela mtini, “Kuhumala lelo hata machuwa yayendelela mundu yeyose akotoho kulyegha matungula kuhuma kwa wenga.” Na wayitikila ghaki wayoghaniliti milandu hila.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyingila ku Lighuta lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayu 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Hinu, wakahika Yelusalemu. Yesu akayingila mu lighuta gha Sapanga akatumbula kuwawinga panji wandu wavile wakiwusa na kuhemela vindu mula. Akaghalambula vindangawala vya wala wavile wakipeghana mapesa kwa mapesa, na vikalilo vya wala wavile wakiwusa ngunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Kamlekesela ngʼogha mundu yeyose kukola chochose kupitila mu lyugha gha lighuta gha Sapanga. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Hinu akawavula milandu hai, “Iyandikiliwi ku mayandiko gha Sapanga, lighuta lyangu litekemwa Lighuta gha mayupo kwaikiva gha wandu wa milima hyogha. Ila mwenga muighalambula kuvile mahala kwa kujihigha wapokola.” <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Watambika wakulu na wavula wa ulaghililo pa wayoghanila lilando hali, wakahakula njila gha kumkoma Yesu. Ila wamtiliti Yesu, kwa ikiva wandu wogha walikangasiti na mavula ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Pa ihikili lumihi, Yesu na wayitikila ghaki wahukilili kumbwani.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavula kuhuma libiki lilela tini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayu 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Kilau ghaki malawila, pa wavile wakityanga, wakalola lila libiki lya tini, liwela liyuma lyogha, kuhuma kunani mbaka pahi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petulo akumbwikili, akamlongela Yesu, “Mvula, uloli! hula mtini ulapilili, uyuma.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu akawalongela,“Mumkwinili Sapanga.” <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Ninguwalongela unagha mundu akiulongela utumbi hau, “Utupuki ukadubukili mbahali, ng'ogha aviki kulihola mmoyu ghaki, ila akakwinila mighalu hyogha angulonga yangugholeka, utegholelwa mghalu hau.” <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kwaikiva ninguwalongela pamyupa na kuluwa kindu mkwinili yiwa mpokela, na kyeni kitevile kya wenga. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Pamgholoka kuyupa, “Mlekeseli kila mundu awahakilili chochosi, ili Tati wa mwenga avile kundumba awalekeseli mahakata gha mwenga,” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Ila pa muwalekesela ng'ogha ghangi, hata Tati wa mwenga avile kundumba atewalekesela ng'ogha mwenga mahakata.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uweso wa Yesu unguhuma kugha?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayu 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu na wayitikila ghaki wakahika kangi Yelusalemu. Yesu pa avile akityanga ku lighuta gha Sapanga, wakulu wa matambiku na wavula wa ulaghililo pamonga na mambuyi, wakamhikila. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Wakamkonya, “Ungughola mighalu hagha kwa uwesa wa ghani? Ghani akupeghilili uwesa wa kughola Mighalu hagha?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu akawalongela, nitewakonya lilando limonga, mteniyanga, na nenga kangi nitewalongela Ningughola mighalu hagha kwa uwesa ghani. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Mniyangi, “Ghuli, uwesa wa Yohana wa kubatisa uhumilili kundumba kwa Sapanga au kwa wandu?” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Wakatumbula kulongelana, “Patulonga, ‘Yahumilili kundumba kwa Sapanga,’ Atetukonya, ghuli mumkwinili ng'ogha Yohana?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Na patulonga, “Yahumilili kwa wandu,” watilili lipinga lya wandu kwa ikiva wandu wogha wakwinilili yiwa Yohana avilili nagha mlota wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Hinu, wakamyanga Yesu, “Twenga tumanya ng'ogha,” na mweni Yesu akawalongela, “Na nenga kangi niwalongela ng'ogha ningughola mighalu hagha kwa uwesa ghani,”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa litawa lya Mizabibu na mtukutula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayu 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu akatumbula kulonga na weni kwa milandano, “Mundu mmonga atukutulili litawa lya mizabibu. Akachenga lyugha kutindila litawa, akachenga mhala pa kukamulila divai akachenga kilingo kangi. Kalihusa kwa lipindi litawa lila kwa watukutula, akayenda mwanja mbaka mlima wa kutali.”<figure style="fig" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" ref="12:1">Wandu wavili wangukamula zabibu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Lipindi lya kubena amlaghilili mtumikila ghaki kwa wala watukutula, akamyegheli lihomoso ghaki lya mabeno gha litawa lyake. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Wala watukutula wakamkamula, wakamtova yula mtumikila, wakamuhuyisa miwoku ivile na hindu ng'ogha. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Na mweni litawa akalaghila kangi mtumikila ghangi. Na mweni, wakamuhakili ku mutu na kumgholela mahakata ngenju. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Yula mweni litawa akamlaghilila kangi mtumikila ghangi, na weni wakamkoma. Na wakawagholela watangala walaghililwi na mweni litawa, wamonga wawatovilili na ghangi wakawakoma. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mweni litawa ahighalilwi na mwana mmonga, avile mwana ghaki ampalili. Kumwihu akamlaghila hayu akilonga, “Watemtundamila mwana ghangu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ila wala watukutula wakalongelana, “Hayu ndiwa mlihi, hinu tumkomi, ili ulihi ghaki uvile wa twenga.” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Hinu wakamkamula, wakamkoma, na kumdanga panji gha lila litawa lya mizabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Hinu Yesu akawakonya, “Mweni litawa ateghola kyani? Atehika kuwayalamisa hagha watukutula. Na hinu atehusa kwa lipindi kwa watukutula ghangi lila litawa lya mizabibu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ghuli, msoma ng'ogha hagha Mayandiko gha Sapanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">“Liganga walilemili wachengaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">hinaa livile liganga likulunga lya mmbali.”<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />“Bambu ndiwa agholili mghalu hau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">na hau ni wa kukangasa nesu kwa twenga.ʼ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Hinu wala Watambika wakulu na wavula wa ulaghililo na wambuyi wahakulili njila gha kumkola Yesu, kwa ikiva wamanyili yiwa alongili mlandano hau kwa weni. Ila kwa ikiva watilili lipinga lya wandu, wakamleka ajiyendeli.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhipa kodi kwa Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayu 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Hinu, wamonga wa Mafalisayo na lipinga lya Helode wayeghilwi ili wamteghi Yesu kwa kumkonya milandu ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Pawamuhikilili Yesu, wakamkonya, “Mvula, tungumanya yiwa wenga ni mundu wa maha na ungulongela unagha . Hilahila uloli ngʼogha ukulu wa mundu ila unguvula kwa unagha njila zya Sapanga kuzikovekela. Utulongeli hinu, ulaghilo ungutulongela kuhipa kodi kwa Mfalumi Mkulu wa Roma au ngʼogha? Ingudahilwa kuhipa au ngʼogha?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ila Yesu amanyili ukalamuka ghao, akawalongela, “Ghuli mnguniyesa? Mnilangihi hai mapesa niilole.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Wakamlangiha lila ligwala, na mweni akawakonya, “Wuso na lihina hali ni lya ghani?” Wakamuyanga, “Ni gha Nduna Mkulu wa Roma.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Hinu, Yesu akawalongela, “Gha Nduna Mkulu wa Roma mumpeghi vivili ghaki, na gha Sapanga mumpeghi Sapanga.” Wakangaswa nesu na mweni.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mghalu wa kuhinduka wahovili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayu 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Hinu, Masadukayo wawelili wakilonga yiwa kwahela uhinduki wamuhikilili Yesu, wakamkonya, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mvula, Musa atulaghilili nagha, ‘Mundu akihova na kuleka mdala ngʼogha mwana. Mlongu ghaki angudahilwa amtole hayu mdala ahovitiliwi na mlumi, ili ampatile mlongu ghaki wana’. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Hinu, kuvile na walongu isaba. Wa kutumbula aposili, akahova ngʼogha kuleka mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Mlongu wa ivili akamposa yula mdala wa ahovili, na mweni kangi akahova ngʼogha kumleka mwana, na mlongu wa itatu hilahila. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Wogha isaba wahovili na ngʼogha kuleka mwana. Ku mwihu yula mdala wa mlumi ahovili na mweni akahova. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Hinu, Lichuwa wandu watehinduka, mdala hayu atevile mdala wa ghani? Wogha isaba wavile wamposili.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mwenga myaghanika kwaikiva mmanya ng'ogha Mayandiko gha Sapanga ng'ogha makakala gha Sapanga.” <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Kwa ikiva wahovili pa wahinduki wateposa ngʼogha na kuposwa, watevile handa Wandumindumi wa Sapanga wa kundumba. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Ila kulongela kuhinduliwa kwa wahovili, ghuli msoma ngʼogha hitabu kya Musa ku mahala kulongela kila kiputila kivile kinguyaka lyoto? Sapanga amlongelili Musa, “Nenga ni Sapanga wa Ibulahimu na Sapanga wa Isaka na Sapanga wa Yakobu.ʼ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Hinu, mweni ngʼogha Sapanga wa wahovili, ila ni Sapanga wa wavile wakomu. Mwenga myaghanika nesu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laghilo ngulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayu 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mmonga wa wavula wa ulaghililo ahikili, akahyoghanila malongelano ghao. Pa alolili yiwa Yesu awayangili maha, akajihumila, akamkonya, “Ku malaghilo yogha ni malaghilo ghani yavile gha mtumbula?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu akamuyanga, “Laghilo ngulu ni hali, mhyoghanili mwenga wandu wa Izilaeli, Bambu Sapanga wa twenga, ndiwa weka hela Bambu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Umpali Bambu Sapanga ghako kwa moyu ghako wogha, kwa Upumulo ghako wogha, kwa maghala ghako yogha na kwa makakala ghako yogha.ʼ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Na gha ivili ndiwa hai, “Umpali muyaku handa ujipalili mweni. kwa hela laghilo ghangi livile ngulu gha hazi.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Yula mvula wa ulaghilo akamlongela Yesu, “Ni maha, mvula, ulongiti unagha yiwa Sapanga ni mmonga weka hela ngʼogha Sapanga ghangi ila mweni. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Na mundu angudahilwa kumpala Sapanga kwa moyu ghaki wogha, kwa lughala lwaki lwogha na kwa makakala ghaki yogha, na mweni angudahilwa kumpala muyake handa vila ajipalili mweni. Mighalu hai ni maha nesu kuphita kumpegha Sapanga litambiku lya kulungusa kwa lyoto na mapegho.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu pa alolili yiwa ayangili kwa lughala, akamlongela, “Wenga uvili Kutali ngʼogha na ufalumi wa Sapanga.” Badili gha ghala kuvile ngʼogha mundu kangi wa kumkonya.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito aghagulilwi na Sapanga ni ghani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayu 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Lipindi Yesu avile akivula ku Lighuta lya Sapanga, akonyili, “Ghuli wavula wa ulaghililo wangulonga yiwa Kilisito ni mwana wa Daudi?” <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Daudi mweni akilongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Bambu amlongelili Bambu wa nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Utami upandi wa nenga wa kulihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">mbaka niwaviki wahakata ghako pahi gha maghulu ghako. <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />“Daudi mweni angumkema Kilisito Bambu. Hinu, Kilisito atevile ghuli mwana ghaki?” Lipinga likulunga lya wandu limyoghaniliti Yesu kwa luheku.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlikali mihu na mavulo gha wavula wa ulaghililo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Pa awelili anguwavula Yesu alongilili, “Mlikali mihu na wavula wa ulaghililo. Wavili wangupala kutyanga wamevala lihabiti litali, na kujambuswa kwa utundamilo ku lighuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Wangudahila hilahila kutama ku vikalilo vya kuulongolo mghati mwa lighuta zya kuyupila Wayahudi na kuvile na mahala pa utundamilu ku mhambu. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Wangupoka hindu gha wahovilwi na walumi ghao na kuyupa mayupo matali ili wawoneki kuulongolo gha wandu. Kwa ikiva gha hagha lichuwa lya ulamula watepokela uhakili mtopehu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hupo gha nyongo mgane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu avile katama pabehi na lisanduku lya mapegho. Akavile akilola ghuli wandu wanguvika mapesa ku lisanduku lya mapegho gha Lighuta lya Sapanga. Wandu wavile na hindu ngoo wayeghili mapegho yatangala. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Pala akahika nyongo mmonga ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki na avile na hindu ngʼogha, akayegha sendi ivili gha shaba. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Pala Yesu akawakema wayitikila ghaki, akawalongela, “Uchakaka ninguwalongela, nyongo hayu ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki avile na hindu ngʼogha kavika mu lisanduku lya mapegho mapesa zitangala kuphita wogha watayiti.” <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kwa ikiva hagha ghangi wogha watolili kuhuma ku yahighalili gha hindu ghao, ila hayu nyongo, pamonga na avile na hindu ngʼogha kayegha yogha aikolili, ameyegha kila kindu kivile kiwesa kumtanga ku kulama kwaki.<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angulonga kukologhanyilwa kwa lighuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayu 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu pa avile akihuma mu Lighuta, mmonga ghao gha wayitikila ghaki akamlongela, “Mvula, uloli maganga hagha na nyumba hasi zivile maheli zya kukangasa.” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ghuli mnguyalola manyumba hagha yavile gha maheli gha kukangasa? Kwa hela hata liganga limonga litesyehila kwa ghangi, kila kindu kitepalaghanyiswa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lungʼai na mahakili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayu 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu pa avile kalikala ku litumbi lya Mizeituni akilola ku Lighuta lya Sapanga, Petelo na Yakobu na Yohanana Andelea wakamkonya kwa kuhigha, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Utulongeli mighalu hagha itehumila ligha? Ni kilangihi ghani kitelangiha yiwa mighalu hagha ivile pabehi kuhumila?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu akatumbula kuwalongela, “Mlikali mihu, mkotoho kuyaghanika na mundu.” <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Kwa ikiva wandu watangala watehika wakilitumila lihina lyangu, kila mmonga akilonga, “Nenga ni kilisito” na weni watehika kuwalongela uhwangi wandu watangala. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Kangi mkotoho nyengemala pamtehyoghanila mighalu gha maghaso pabehi na milandu ilongela ngondu kwa utali. Mighalu hagha ingudahilwa ihumile, ila mwihu weni umbila kuhika. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Wandu wamonga watetovana na wandu ghangi, Unduna mmonga utetovana na Unduna ghangi, kila lipandi kutevile na mihihimilo gha pahi na lung'ahi lwa njala ngulu. Mighalu hagha ni handa vila mahakili gha utumbula gha kulela mwana. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Ila mwenga mlikali mihu, kwa ikiva wandu watewayegha ku njengakaya, na kuwatova ku Lighuta zya kukonganika Wayahudi. Mteyeghwa kuulongolu gha vilongosi na Wanduna kwa ikiva gha nenga, ili mpati kunihighilisa kwa weni.” <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ila ingudahilwa itumbuli kutangaswa Lilandu Maha ku wandu wogha. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Na weni pawatewakamula na kuwayegha ku njengakaya, mkotoho kuvile na holu kwa yala mteyalonga, lipindi lila pa lihika mlongi chochosi mtepeghwa kulonga, kwa ikiva ngʼogha mwenga mtevile mkilonga, ila Mpumulo wa Sapamga. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mlongu atemhyuka mlongu ghaki ili akomwe, na tati atemhyuka mwana ghaki, na wana weni baha watewahyuka walela ghao na kuwakoma. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Wandu wogha watewahyomela mwenga kwa ikiva gha nenga. Ila yula atenyuka moyu ng'ogha mbaka mwihu ndiwa atekombolwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu watekolwa na lung'ahi ngulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayu 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Pamtelola ‘kindu kihakata’ kimghola Sapanga ahyomi,” kigholoka mahala kidahililwi ng'ogha kuvile. Yula asoma milandu hagha amanyi lukani lwake. Hinu wala watelikala Yudasia, watuwilili ku mitumbi. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Avile kunani gha mlipaghala lya lighuta ghaki akotoho kughuluka na kuyingila ukaya ghaki kutola kindu. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Avile mlitawa akotoho kuhuya kuyetu kutola nguu zyake. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Itevile uhakili kwa wadala wavile na ndumbu na weni kuyongesa. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mu myupi Sapanga ili mighalu hagha ikotoho kuhumila lipindi lya lupepu. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kwa ikiva ku lipindi lila kutevile na lung'ahi likulunga liwesa kuwoneka ng'ogha hata mayaghani kuhuma lichuwa lila Sapanga awumbili mlima wogha mbaka hinaa, ng'ogha kuhika kangi uhakili handa hau. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Handa Bambu angapungusili ng'ogha machuwa ghala gha mahakili, kwa hela hata mundu mmonga avile angelokolwa kihu. Kwa vila wahaghuliwa awahaghulili kazipungula. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Hinu mundu akiwalongela, ‘Mloli, Kilisito kabaha,’ au ‘avile pala,’ mkotoho kumkwinila.” <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kwa ikiva kutehumila “Kilisito wa uhwangi, pamonga na walota wa Sapanga wa uhwangi, wateghola kilangihi na mkangaso, kwa ikiva gha kuwayalamisa wahaghulilwi wa Sapanga handa ikiwesekana.” <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Ila mwenga mlikali mihu kwa ikiva niwalongela kala hagha yogha kuulongolo.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayu 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Hinu, machuwa ghala, lung'ahi hula pa uphita, lijuwa litetaywa lwisa na mwehi utelangasa ng'ogha. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Ndondwa ziteguwa kuhuma kunani, na makakala gha kunani ku mahindu yatetikwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Baha watemlola Mwana wa Mundu akihika mu mahindu kwa makakala yatangala na ukwilikihi. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Hinu atewalaghila watumikila wa Sapanga kundumba ghaki wahaghulilwi wandu ghaki kuhuma pandi zyogha inne zya mlima wogha, kuhuma mwihu wa mlima wogha mbaka mwihu wa kundumba.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa libiki lya mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayu 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Kwa mlandano wa mtini na mjivuli mlandano hau, bwitu maputila ghaki pa yatumbula kuvile pyeku na kuyalula mahamba, mtemanya yiwa lipindi lya kubena lya pabehi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Hilahila, lipindi pamlola mighalu hagha inguhumila, mmanyi yiwa Mwana wa Mundu ka pabehi. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ninguwalongela unagha, kiwelekwa haki kya mwenga kitehuka ng'ogha mbaka mighalu hagha yogha kuhika. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Kundumba na mlima wogha vitehuka, ila milandu gha nenga itehuka ng'ogha.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwahela awesa kumanya lichuwa na lisaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayu 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Ila kwahela mundu angumanya lichuwa au lisaa, hata watumikila wa Sapanga wa kundumba, pamonga na mwana amanya ng'ogha, ila Tati weka hela ndiwa angumanya. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mlikali mihu na mlikali maha, kwa ikiva mmanya ng'ogha lisaa hali litetimila ligha. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Itavile handa mundu anguhuka ukaya kuyenda mwanja, akiwalekela watumikila ghaki kuilolela, kila mmonga na lihengu lyake, akamlongela na mgholokela wa mlyango akotoho kuwonja lughonu. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Mtami maha hinu, kwa ikiva mmanya ng'ogha mweni lighuta anguhuya ligha, inguwesekana ikavile lumihi, uhiku wa mandandu, malawila pee au malawila. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Mtami maha ili pa ahika bwitu akotoho kuwalola muwonja. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Yala niwalongela mwenga, ninguwalongela wogha, mlikali maha.”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Mghalu wa kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayu 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ihighalili machuwa maivili pambila gha kuhika mhambu gha Pasaka na gha mibumunda itayitwi ngʼogha ijejema. Watambika wakulu na wavula wa ulaghililo wavile wahakili njila gha kumkamula Yesu kwa ukalamuki ili wamkomi. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ila walongili, “Tukotoho kumkamula lipindi lya mhambu wa Pasaka, ili wandu wakotoho kughola maghaso.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyitilwa mahuta gha kunungila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayu 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu avile ku mlima wa Besania, ukaya kwa Simoni Mkalawa. Pavile ku mesa kulyegha mulyo, nyongo mmonga avile na supa gha liganga walikema alabasita ivile na mahuta yanungila gha mapesa ngulu akahika, akaibalula hila supa, akamwahila Yesu mahuta hagha ku mutu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Wamonga gha wandu wavile pala wahyomili, wakajilongela, “Kwa kyani mahuta hagha yanguyalamika hela?” <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Mahuta hagha yangewesa kuhuswa kwa dinali imia itatu, na kuwapegha wangali hindu mapesa hazi. Na wakamkalipila yula mdala nesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ila Yesu akawalongela, “Mlekeni, kwa kyani mngumghasa? kanigholela mhalu wamaha. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />wandu wavile na hindu ngʼogha machuwa yogha na mnguwesa kuwatanga lipindi lyolyosi pampalili, ila nenga nitevile ngʼogha pamonga na mwenga machuwa yogha. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Mdala hayu kaghola kila awesili, kalongola kupakala mahuta higha gha nenga kwa ikiva gha kusikwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ninguwalongela, Una kokosi mlima wogha Lilandu Maha litetangaswa, mghalu hau agholili kitetangaswa kwa kumkumbwike mweni.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi anguyitikila kumyuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayu 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Hinu Yudasi Isikalioti, mmonga wa wala ikumi na ivili, ayendili kwa watambika wakulu ili kumhyuka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Watambika wakulu pa wayoghanilili mghalu hula, wakahekelela, wakamlongela watempegha mapesa. Hinu, Yudasi Akatumbula kuhaka lipindi maha gha kumyuka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulyegha mulyo gha Pasaka pamonga na wayitikila ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayu 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Lichuwa lya mtumbula lya mhambu gha mikati itayitwi ngʼogha ujejema, lipindi livile mwana kondolu wa Pasaka uhinjwa, wayitikila ghaki wakamkonya Yesu, “Tukutengeli kugha mhambu gha pasaka.” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Hinu Yesu akawalaghila waivili wa wayitikila ghaki akiwalongela, “Myendi kumbwani, na haku mtekongana na mlumi mmonga apapili ndeleku gha masi. Mumkovikeli,” <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mbaka kulighuta ateyingila, mkamlongeli mweni lighuta, “Mvula angulonga, ki kugha kyumba kya nenga pavile nitelyegha pasaka pamonga na wavulwa ghangu?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Na mweni atewalangiha kyumba kikulu kya kunani kivikilwi maha na vyogha vidahilwa kwa twenga. “Mtutengeli hamu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Wayitikila wakahuka wakayenda mmuji, walolili kila kindu maha handa yesu avile kawalongela. Wakatengela mulyo gha pasaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Pa ihikili lumihi, Yesu ahikili pamonga na wayitikila ghaki ikumi na ivili. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Pa wavile wakilyegha mulyo, Yesu akalonga, “Unagha ninguwalongela mmonga wa mwenga angulyegha pamonga na nenga, atenihyuka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Pala wayitikila ghaki wakatumbula kulihola, wakamkonya mmonga mmonga, “Ghuli ni nenga?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ni mmonga wa mwenga ikumi na ivili, yula anguchwika libumunda pamonga na nenga mlibakuli. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Kwa ikiva Mwana wa Mundu atehova handa mayandiko Makwilikihi yangulonga kwa mweni, ila itevile ihakili kwa yula mundu atemhyuka mwana wa mundu, ingevile mbaha kwa mweni akotoho kuwelekwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulyo gha Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayu 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Wakolintu 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Pa wavile wangulyegha, Yesu akatola likati, akauhighila, hinu akametula na kuwapegha wayitikila ghaki, akilonga, “Mtole hau ndiwa higha ghangu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Hinu a katola kitekelu, akamhighila Sapanga na akawapegha wayitikila, na weni wogha wakakinyweghela. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Na Yesu akawalongela, “Hau ndiwa mwahi ghangu wa lilaghano, mwahi unguyitika kwa lukani lya wandu ngenju. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Unagha ninguwalongela, nitenywegha ngʼogha kangi divai hai mbaka lichuwa lila paniteinywegha uhyonu mu Unduna wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Hinu wakayimba uyimbo, wakahuka, wakayenda ku litumbi lya mizeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongela yatehumila kuulongolo yiwa Petulo atemkanila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayu 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu akawalongela wayitikila ghaki, “Mwenga wogha mtegua, kwa ikiva mayandiko Makwilikihi yangulonga, ‘Nitemtova mhungaji, na kondolu watetikimuka haku na kula.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ila panihinduka kala, nitewalongola ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petelo akamlongela Yesu, “Hata ikiva wogha ghangi wakikuleka nenga nitekuleka ngʼogha.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu akamyanga Petelo, “Unagha ningukulongela, uhiku hau, pambila njogholu katova lilowi ngʼogha mihanja mi ivili, utevile unihyukakala mihanja mi itatu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ila Petelo akayendelela kulonga kwa makakala, “Hata itedahilwa nihovi pamonga na wenga, nitekuleka ngʼogha.” Wayitikila wogha kangi wakalonga hilahila.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyupa kukitawa Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:35-46">Matayu 26:35-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Hinu, wakahika kukitawa kikemilwi Getisemani. Yesu akawalongela wayitikila ghaki, “Mtami baha lipindi nenga ninguyupa.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Hinu akawatola Petelo na Yakobu na Yohanana kuyenda na weni. Akatumbula kulihola nesu na kughasika. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Akawalongela, “Ningulihola nesu mumoyu hata pabehi kuhova. Mtami baha na mvile mihu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Akayenda kuulongolo mayaghani na weni, akajidanga pahi. Akayupa yiwa pa iwesekana, lisaa lila lya uhakili limuhuki kutali. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Akalonga, “Tati ghangu, kwa wenga mighalu yogha inguwesekana. Unihumisili kitekelu haki, ila ikotoho kuwela handa nipalili nenga, ila upalili wenga.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Hinu Yesu ahuyili kwa wala wayitikila waitatu, awawonili wawonja. Hinu, akamkonya Petulo, “Simoni, ghuli, kughonja? kuwesa ng'ogha kulikala mihu hata kwa lisaa limonga?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Hinu akawalongela, “Mlikali mihu na kuyupa ili mkotoho kuyingila mumayeso. Mpumulo ungudahila ila higha iwesa ngʼogha.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Akayenda kuyupa kangi akihuyila milandu hila hila. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Hinu akahuya kangi, akawalola wawonjili. Mihu ghao ikolilwi nesu na lughono, na weni wasinditwi kumanya yiwa wamyangi niki. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Paahuyili kwa lihanja lya itatu, akawalongela, “Mmbila mnguwonja na kupumulila? muwonja nesu hinaa myimuki! lisaa lihika kala! Mwana wa Mundu anguyeghwa kwa wandu wahakata. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Muyimuki tuyende mlole, yula mundu atenikanila ahikili kala pabehi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angukamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayu 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu pakayomola ngʼogha kulonga, Yudasi, mmonga wa wala ikumi na ivili, akahika pamonga na lipinga lya wandu wavile na mipanga na mimbonga. Wandu wala wavile wayeghitwi na watambika wakulu, wavula wa ulaghililo na wagogolo. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Hinu Yudasi Isikalioti avile kawapegha kilangihi, “Yula nitembusi ndiwa mweni, mumkole na kumyegha pahi gha ugholokela.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yudasi pa ahikili, akamuyendela Yesu na kumlongela, “Mvula.” Kangi akamkusikila. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Hinu wala wandu wakamkola Yesu, wakamkamula na kumgholokela kwa pabehi. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Mmonga paghati gha wala wagholokili pamonga na Yesu, akahomola lipanga ghaki, akamtova mtumikila wa mtambika mkulu na akamdumula lipulikilo. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ghuli, mhika na mipanga na mimbonga kunikola handa wandu wayenda kumkola mpokola? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Kila lichuwa nivile pamonga na mwenga nikivula mu lighuta gha Sapanga, mnikola ngʼogha. Ila hinaa ingudahilwa Mayandiko Makwilikihi yagholwe.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Pala wayitikila wogha wamlekili, wakatula mbilo. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Ila msongolo mmonga avalili mgololi mbulete ayendelelili kumkovikela Yesu. Wakayesa kumkamula, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Ila mweni akatyelebuka akawalekesela mgolole mbulete hula na kutula mbilu akiva lipala ng'ogha nguu.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuulongolo gha njengakaya gha mambuyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayu 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-67">63-67</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Hinu, wakamyegha Yesu kwa mtambika mkulu wavile vilongosi wa watambika wakulunga wogha, mambuyi na wavula wa ulaghililo wavile walikungula. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petelu akamkovekela Yesu kwa utali, akayingila mghati mwa lyugha wa mtambika mkulu, akatama pamonga na wagholokela akilota liloto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Wakulu wa matambiku wakulu na wandu wa njengakaya ngulu yogha wahakulili ulangihi wa kumghola Yesu ili wawese kumkomwa, ila waulolili ngʼogha. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Wandu watangala wayeghili ulangihi wa uhwangi kumsitaki Yesu, ila vilangihi ghao vilandinili ngʼogha. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Hinu ghangi wagholokili, wakayegha ulangihi wa uhwangi wakilonga, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Tumyoghanilili mundu hayu akilonga, ‘Niteiyalamisa lighuta lya Sapanga hai ichengilwi kwa mawoko, na kwa machuwa itatu niteichenga ghangi ivile ichengwili ngʼogha na wandu.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ila hata nagha ulangihi wa weni ulandinili ngʼogha. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Hinu, Mtambika Mkulu akagholoka kuulongolo ghao na kumkonya Yesu, “Ghuli, uyangi lilando ngʼogha? Wandu hagha wangukusitaki niki wenga?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ila mweni akatama nuu, alongilili ngʼogha hata lilando limonga. Matambika Mkulu akamkonya kangi, “Ghuli wenga ndiwa Kilisito, mwana wa Sapanga m mkwilikihi?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu akayanga, “Hina ndiwa nenga, Kangi mtemlola Mwana wa Mundu atamili upandi wa kuliyila wa yula Bambu avile na likakala, akihika mumahundi gha kundumba.” <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Pala Mtambika Mkulu akalakatula nguu zyake, akalonga, “Tungudahila ulangihi wa niki kangi wa kumsitaki. <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Myoghanila weni amlighili Sapanga. Munguliwachila niki?” Wogha wakamulamula yiwa angupalwa ahovi. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Hinu ghangi paghati gha weni watumbulili kumuhunyila Yesu mata, wakamugubika mihu na kumtova, na kumlongela, “Uloti hinaa ni ghani akutovili!” Hata wagholokela wakamtola na kumtova mbandi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angumkanila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayu 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petelo pa avile ambila pahi mghati gha lyugha, mmonga wa watumikila wadala wa Mtambika Mkulu akahika pala. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Paamwonili Petelo akilota lyoto, akamlola na kumlongela, “Wenga hilahila uvile pamonga na Yesu wa Nazaleti.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ila Petelo akamkanila, “Manya ngʼogha,wala nimanya ngʼogha unguyalongela!” Hinu Petelo akahuka, akayenda panji mliuwa. baha njogholu akatova lilowi. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Yula mtumikila pamlolili kangi Petelo akatumbula kangi kuwalongela wandu wavile wawolokili pala, “Mundu hayu ni mmonga wa weni.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petelo akanili kangi. Lisaa mayaghani, wandu wavile wagholoka pala wakamlongela Petelo, “Kwa unagha wenga ni mmonga wa weni, kwa ikiva wenga ni Mgalilaya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Ila Petelo akatumbula kulapila na kulapa akilonga, “Nenga ningummanya ngʼogha mundu hayu mngulonga habali zyaki.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Lipindi lilalila njogholu akatova lilowi lihanja lya ipili. Hinu Petelo akumbwike ikiva Yesu avile amlongelili, “Pambila njogholu kuhuyila ngʼogha lyanja lya ipili kutova lilowi, utenikanila miyanja itatu.” Petelo ahumilwi na masosi.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyeghwa kwa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayu 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Pa kulangalili, Watambika Wakulu wagholili lilando pamonga na wagogolo, wavula wa ulaghililo na wandu wa njengakaya yogha, wakamuwopa Yesu ngoi, wakamyegha na kumtula kwa Pilatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilatu akamkonya Yesu, “Ghuli, wenga ni Nnduna wa Wayahudi?” Yesu akamyanga, “Hina ivile handa ulongili.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Watambika Wakulu wakamsitaki Yesu kwa mighalu itanala. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilatu akamkonya kangi Yesu, “Wenga uyangi ngʼogha lilando? Uloli milandu hagha yogha wangukusitakila” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ila Yesu ayangili ngʼogha lilando lolose kangi, hata Pilatu akalikangasa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angusitakiwa kuhova</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayu 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kila lipindi lya mhambu wa Pasaka, Pilatu asyoelelili kuwawoposelela wandu muwopwa mmonga, yula wamdahila. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Pavile na muwopwa mmonga, akemilwi Balaba, awopilwi pamonga na wandu walipingili ulongosi na wavile wayambusili wandu kuhova mumaghaso. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Wandu wakamyendela Pilatu, wakatumbula kumluwa awagholeli handa agholili kula kuyetu. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilatu akawayanga, “Mngudahila niwawoposeleli Nduna wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilatu alongili vila kwaikiva amanyili yiwa Watambika Wakulu wamyeghili Yesu kwa mweni kwa ikiva gha wifu. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ila Watambika Wakulu wakawatumisila wandu wamluwi Pilatu awawoposeleli Balaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilatu akawakonya wandu kangi, “Hinu mngudahila nighole niki na hayu mumkema Nduna wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Wandu wogha wakatova lilowi kangi, “Amvambi kumsalaba.” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Ila Pilatu akawakonya, “Kwa niki! Kaghola uhakata liki?” Ila weni wakayendelela kutova lilowi nesu, “Amvambi kumsalaba.” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Kwa ikiva Pilatu apalili kulihekelelesa lila lipinga lya wandu. Hinu, akamuwoposola Balaba kuhuma ku uwopwa. Akawalongela wamtovi Yesu hyatu, hinu akamyegha wamvambi kumsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watovangondo wangumpughanya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayu 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Hinu watovangondo wamyeghili Yesu mghati gha lyugha lya lighuta lya Mkulu wa mlima gha Yudasia na weni wakakema lipinga lyao lyogha walikungulili. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Wakamvika nguu zya zambalau na wakamfyokotolela kindu handa likokoma ligholitwi kwa mihomi, wakamvikila Yesu kumutu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Hinu wakatumbula kumjambusa, wakilonga, “Kayimuka Bambu, Nduna wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Wakamtova lidengi kumutu, wakamuhunyila mata, wakamuyinamila na kumtundamila kuulongolo ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Pawayomolili kumupughanya, wakamuwoposola hila nguu gha Zambalau wakamvika nguu zyaki, hinu wakamyegha panji kuyenda kumuvamba kumsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvambwa mlipingika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayu 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Pawavile mnjila. Wakonganili na mundu mmonga akemilwi Simoni, mweni kaya wa Kulene. Avile tati ghao Alekisanda na Lufu, na lipindi lila avile anguhuma mlitawa. Hinu, wakamng'ang'anisa atoli apapi lipingika lya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Hinu wamyeghili Yesu mbaka mahala pakemilwi Goligota, imanyika mahala pa lifufu lya Mutu. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Wampeghili divai ihanganyiliwi na mtela ukemilwi manemane ila mweni alemili kunywegha. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Hinu, wamvambili ku lipingika, wapeghanili nguu syake kwa kuyavalangila kula walamuli ni ghani apokeli kyani. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Iwelili isaa itatu malawila pawamvambili kulipingika. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Likayandikwa litangasu lya lisitaka ghaki mulibau yiwa, “Nduna wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Pamonga na mweni wawavambili kumipingika ghao wapokola waivili, mmonga upandi wa mweni wa kulihila na ghangi upandi ghaki wa shotu. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Pala ndiwa mayandiko makwilikihi yatimilili yalongili, “Avalangililwi lipinga limonga na wahakata.” <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Wandu wavile wakityanga mahala pala wamlighili, wakatikaha mitu ghao na kulonga, “Iii! Wenga, Wenga baha upalili kubomola lighuta gha Sapanga na kuchenga lingi kumachuwa itatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Hinaa, ughuluki kumsalaba ujilokoli mwenibaha.” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Na hilahila Watambika Wakulu pamonga na wavula wa ulaghililo wampughanyili wakilonga, “Awalokolili wandu ghangi, ila mweni awesili ng'ogha kujilokola. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Uleki tulole hayu ni Kilisito ahaghulilwi na Sapanga, Nduna wa Waizilaeli, ajighulusi hinaa kunani gha msalaba, ili na twenga tuwese kulola na kukwinila.” Hata wala wavambilwi kumisalaba pamonga na mweni wamlighili hilahila.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhova kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayu 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Pa ihikili isaa isita gha pamuhi, lwisa litopehu lilandalili ku mlima wogha mbaka isaa itisa. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Saa itisa Yesu akalila kwa lilowi likulunga, akalonga, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Hilahila ingumanyika, “Sapanga wa nenga, Sapanga wa nenga, ghuli ungunileka?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Na wandu wamonga wawolokili pala pa wayughanilili vila, wakalonga, “Uyughanili! Angumkema Elia.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Na mmonga wa weni akatula mbilo, akachwika lidodoki mghati mwa divai isasili na kuwopela kunani gha lidenge. Akampegha anyweghi akilonga, “Mleki tuloli handa Elia atehika kumughulusa kunani gha lipingika!” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ila Yesu akalila kwa lilowi likulunga, akahova. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Hinu, lipazia lya lighuta libalukili vipandi vi ivili kuhuma kunani mbaka pahi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mkulu wa watovangondo avile kagholoka kuulongolo gha Yesu, paailolili ghuli angudumuka mpumulo, akalonga, “Ni unagha mundu hayu avile Mwana wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Pavile na wadala wamonga walolili kwa utali. Paghati gha weni kuwela na Malia ahuma ku Magidala na Malia nyongo gha msongolo Yakubu na Yusufu na mdala ghangi Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Wadala hagha ni wala wamkovekelili Yesu na kumutumikila lipindi avile ku Galilaya. Wadala ghangi watangala wamkovekelili mbaka Yelusalemu wawelili pala hilahila.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angusikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayu 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Lipindi lya lumihi pa lihikakala, hai iwelili lichuwa gha kuvika maha, hali lichuwa liilongolili lichuwa lya kupumulila. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Pala akahika Yusufu mwenekaya wa Alimataya, mjumbi wa njengakaya ngulu gha Wayahudi, atundamiliwi nesu. Mweni kangi awelili akilindila kuhika kwa Unduna wa Sapanga. Hinu, amuyendelili Pilatu kahela holu, akaluwa apeghwi higha wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilatu akangasilwi kuhyoghanila ikiva Yesu avile kahova kala. Hinu akamkema mkulu wa watova ngondo, akamkonya yiwa Yesu avile kahova lipindi litali lipitili. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilatu pahighilisiwi na yula Mtovangondo mkulu wa watovangondo yiwa Yesu avile kahova kala. Akamlongela Yusufu atole higha ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yusufu akahemela sanda, akaughulusa pahi hula higha, akautindilila sanda. Akavika ku limambi liwelili lihongoliliwi mliganga likamala, hinu akalibilibisa liganga likulunga kuulongolu gha mlyango. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Na weni Malia ahuma ku Magidala na Malia nyongo ghaki Yusufu wapalolili pala awonjisiliwi.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kuhinduka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayu 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Lichuwa lya Kupumulila pa lipitili, Malia ahuma ku Magadala na Salome na Malia nyongo ghaki Yakobu wahemelili manungilu ili wakapakali higha wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Hinu, malawila pee lichuwa lya mtumbula lya ijuma vilavila ingumanyika jumapili, lipindi lijuwa litumbula kuhomoka, wahikili ku mambi. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Na weni pawawelili mnjila wawili wangukonyana, “Ni ghani atetuhukumila lila liganga kuhuma ku mlyango wa limambi?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ila pa walolili, wakalola liganga lighuswili kala. Na lyeni liwela likulunga nesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Pawayingilili mula mlimambi, wamwonili msongolo mmonga avalili lihabiti mbulete, atamili upandi wa kuliyila, Walikangasa nesu.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ila yula msongolo akawalongela, “Mkotoho kulikangasa. Mngumhaka Yesu wa Nazaleti wamvambili ku lipingika. Kahinduka,” avile ngʼogha baha, Mloli mahala wavile wamwonjesa. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Myendi mkawalongeli wayitikila ghaki pamonga na Petelo yiwa anguwalongola kula ku Galilaya haku ndiwa watemlola handa awalongelili. <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Hinu wahukili kumamambi kunu wakitula mbilo. Wavile wakihihimila na kukangasa nesu. Na weni wamlongelili ngʼogha mundu yeyose, kwa ikiva watilili nesu.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuhumila Malia ahuma ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayu 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohana 20:11-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu pa ahindukili malawila pee, lichuwa lya mtumbula lya ijuma vilavila ingumanyika jumapili, atumbulili kumuhumila Malia Magidalena, yula avile Yesu amuhumisilili mahoka isaba mhigha ghaki. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Malia ahuma ku Magidala akayenda, akawalongela wala wogha wawelili wakilongolana pamonga na Yesu, na lipindi lila wavile wakilumbilila na kulila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ila pawayoghanili yiwa Yesu ni mkomu na yiwa Malia ahuma ku Magidala amwonili, wakwinilili ngʼogha.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahumila wayitikila waivili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Kuulongolo Yesu awahumilili wayitikila ghaki waivili akiva na wuso ghangi. Wayitikila hagha waweli wanguyenda panji gha muji. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Na weni kangi wakayenda, wakawalongela wamonga ghao. Hata nagha wakwinilili ngʼogha.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahumila wayitikila ghaki ikumi na waivili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Matendu 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Kuulongolo Yesu awahumilili wayitikila ikumi na imonga pawavile pamonga wakilyegha mulyo. Akawakalipila nesu kwa ikiva gha kukwinila ngʼogha kwa weni na utatala wa weni, kwa ikiva wamkwinilili ngʼogha wala wavile wamwonili badili gha kuhinduka. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Hinu, akawalongela, “Myendi kumlima wogha mkatangase Lilandu Maha kwa wandu wogha. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yula akwinila na kubatiswa atelokolwa. Akwinila ngʼogha atesitakiwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Na vilangihi havi vitelandine na wala wakwinila. Kwa lihina lya nenga watehumisa mahoka na watelonga kwa luga hyonu. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Pawakolili njoka au wakinywegha kindu chochose kiwesa kuwakoma, kitewahakili ngʼogha. Watevikila wavina mawoku, na weni watepokela ukomu.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutolwa kuyeghwa kundumba kwa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Matendu 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Hinu, Bambu Yesu paalongilikala na weni, akatolwa kundumba kwa Sapanga, akatama upandi wa kulihila wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Hinu wayitikila wakayenda wakitangasa kogha na kogha. Bambu akaghola lihengu pamonga na weni na kuuvikamaha ujumbi hau kwa vilangihi vilandanili pamonga na weni.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>